section "tome-ashes-urhrok/data/birth/corrupted.lua"

t("Doombringer", "毀滅使者", "birth descriptor name")
t("Weapon in hand and sheathed in flame, a Doombringer is a terrifying force in combat.", "利刃在手，烈焰匿蹤，毀滅使者是戰鬥中的強大力量。", "_t")
t("Doombringers are engines of war, cleaving and burning their way through entire armies.", "毀滅使者是純粹的戰爭機器，使用利刃和烈焰直接鑿穿敵人的軍隊。", "_t")
t("The most powerful Doombringers can harness the full power of their demonic ties and transform themselves into a gigantic demon.", "最強大的毀滅使者可以全面激發惡魔血脈，變身成爲巨大的惡魔。", "_t")
t("Their most important stats are: Strength and Magic", "他們最重要的屬性是：力量和魔法。", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Stat modifiers:", "#GOLD# 屬性修正：", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +4 Strength, +0 Dexterity, +2 Constitution", "#LIGHT_BLUE# * +4 力量, +0 敏捷, +2 體質", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +2 Magic, +0 Willpower, +1 Cunning", "#LIGHT_BLUE# * +2 魔法, +0 意志, +1 靈巧", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Life per level:#LIGHT_BLUE# +3", "#GOLD# 每等級生命加值： #LIGHT_BLUE# +3", "_t")
t("Demonologist", "惡魔使者", "birth descriptor name")
t("Most simply run, but I understand: a distant planet, ravaged and damned. Burnt creations seek righteous vengeance, Urh'Rok's ashes, now destruction's engines. Harness their power! Capture and tame! I call on you, demons - UNLEASH THE FLAMES!", "人們常畏懼，但我瞭解真實：遙遠的星球，被厄運所折磨；燃燒的造物們，如今渴望復仇；烏魯洛克之燼，驅動戰爭機器。捕獲並征服！駕馭他們的力量！在此召喚——惡魔們，釋放你們的烈焰！", "_t")
t("Contrary to popular beliefs Demonologists are not the pawns of demons, they enact pacts with them but always very carefully.", "不同於衆人所相信的，惡魔使者並非惡魔的走卒。他們只是小心謹慎地與惡魔簽訂契約。", "_t")
t("They use those demonic powers for their own purpose, often evil but a few have been known to use demonic powers to fight demons.", "他們利用惡魔之力達成所願，無論善惡，亦有少數人以此反擊惡魔。", "_t")
t("Demonologists are melee fighters, bashing their foes skulls with their shields while calling down rains of fire and darkness.", "惡魔使者是近身格鬥的戰士，用盾牌擊碎敵人的頭顱，同時能呼喚黑暗與火焰之力。", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +3 Strength, +0 Dexterity, +2 Constitution", "#LIGHT_BLUE# * +3 力量, +0 敏捷, +2 體質", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +4 Magic, +0 Willpower, +0 Cunning", "#LIGHT_BLUE# * +4 魔法 , +0 意志 , +0 靈巧", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Life per level:#LIGHT_BLUE# +2", "#GOLD# 每等級生命加值： #LIGHT_BLUE# +2", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
section "tome-ashes-urhrok/data/birth/doomelf.lua"

t("Doomelf", "魔化精靈", "birth descriptor name")
t([[The demons of Mal'Rok would never bless you!
Three could tell them of the horrors elves wrought.
One rages and torments in deep oceans blue,
one fights for the third with the cultists she taught.
Silence these beings, maintain your deception,
and then you may witness a new elf's conception...]], [[瑪·洛克的惡魔絕不會對你施以祝福！ 
三者可以訴說精靈所帶來的恐怖
之一在無盡的深海中永遠咆哮
之一召集邪徒爲復活另一者而戰
靜默他們的聲音，隱藏你的蹤影
新的精靈終將誕生…]], "_t")
t("Doomelves are not a real race, they are Shaloren that have been taken by demons and transformed into harbingers of doom.", "魔化精靈並不是一個真正的種族，他們曾是永恆精靈，而被惡魔抓去，變爲末日的使者。", "_t")
t("They enjoy unleashing torments and suffering on their victims.", "他們對摺磨敵人感到享受。", "_t")
t("They possess the #GOLD#Haste of the Doomed#WHITE# talent which allows them to phase away once in a while.", "他們具有#GOLD# 加速 #WHITE# 技能，能每隔一段時間讓自己脫離相位空間。", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Stat modifiers:", "#GOLD# 屬性修正：", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * -2 Strength, +1 Dexterity, +1 Constitution", "#LIGHT_BLUE# * -2 力量, +1 敏捷, +1 體質", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +3 Magic, +2 Willpower, +0 Cunning", "#LIGHT_BLUE# * +3 魔法, +2 意志, +0 靈巧", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Life per level:#LIGHT_BLUE# 9", "#GOLD# 每等級生命加值： #LIGHT_BLUE# 9", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Experience penalty:#LIGHT_BLUE# 12%", "#GOLD#經驗懲罰： #LIGHT_BLUE# 12%", "_t")

