section "tome-ashes-urhrok/data/general/npcs/major-demon.lua"

t("demon", "惡魔", "entity type")
t("major", "大惡魔", "entity subtype")
t("wretch titan", "腐化泰坦", "entity name")
t("Many an adventurer has encounted the wretchling. Terrible things, wretchlings. Swarming, gnashing, burning. What those adventurers don't know is that those are just the children.", "許多冒險家都遭遇過酸液樹魔。相當可怕，酸液樹魔們，成羣出現，灼燒腐蝕。但這些冒險家們不知道，酸液樹魔只是它的未成熟的孩子。", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
section "tome-ashes-urhrok/data/general/objects/world-artifacts.lua"

t("Blackfire Aegis", "黑炎石盾", "entity name")
t("blackened stone shield", "黑色的石質盾牌", "_t")
t("This rugged stone shield flickers with bursts of pitch black flame.", "這個堅固的石盾閃爍着漆黑的火焰。", "_t")
t("releases a burst of dark fire, dealing damage equal to your magic stat", "釋放黑暗之火造成等於魔法屬性的傷害", "_t")
t("Will of Ul'Gruth", "烏爾格魯斯的意志", "entity name")
t("massive metallic gauntlets", "巨型金屬手套", "_t")
t("These massive gauntlets once belonged to a very powerful demon named Ul'Gruth. The behemoth was said to be able to level entire buildings with a single swing of his hands.", "這雙巨大的手套曾經屬於一個名叫烏爾格魯斯的強大的惡魔。據說，這個怪物一揮手就能將一座城市夷爲平地。", "_t")
t("Your Obliterating Smash can destroy walls.", "你的殲滅揮斬能摧毀牆壁", "_t")
t("Fearfire Mantle", "恐懼之焰", "entity name")
t("cloak shaped flames", "火焰般的斗篷", "_t")
t("Black fires born of a blackened heart.", "黑色的火焰從漆黑的心臟中涌出。", "_t")
t("All enemies in radius 2 take 20 fire damage each turn and healing you for 10% of the damage dealt.", "附近2碼範圍的敵人每回合受到20火焰傷害。你受到10%傷害值的治療", "_t")
t("Plague-Fire Sceptre", "疫火權杖", "entity name")
t("darkness infused staff", "充滿黑暗氣息的法杖", "_t")
t("The flames of Mal'Rok can be more stubborn than most. When they run out of fuel they have been known go out of their way to find more.", "瑪·洛克的火焰比一般的火焰更加頑強。當它們無物可燃時，它們知道去哪裏尋找。", "_t")
t("Plaguefire detonates when its victim dies, spreading to other enemies up to two times.", "疫火感染的生物死亡時，疫火將傳播到附近的敵人。至多傳播2次。", "_t")
t("fire a bolt of plaguefire, dealing damage over time based on your magic stat", "召喚出一團疫火，造成基於魔力值的持續傷害。", "_t")
t("Dethblyd", "死忘太劍", "entity name")
t("pitch black sword", "黑色的劍", "_t")
t("Grushgore the Destroyer was as famous for his incredible brutality as he was for his childlike intelligence. He wasn't known for his subtlety of naming, but there's no denying the power of his massive sword.", "毀滅者格魯什戈爾以頭腦簡單四肢發達聞名。他從不擅長謀略，但他的力量無以倫比。", "_t")
t("Increases all damage dealt, and reduces all damage taken, by 1%, stacking up to 10 times. Resets after 10 turns without attacking.", "增加全體傷害並減少受到的傷害各1%效果持續10回合，最多疊加至10層", "_t")
t("Quasit's Skull", "誇塞魔之顱", "entity name")
t("rocky helm", "岩石頭盔", "_t")
t("Some enterprising adventurer seems to have noticed the skin of quasits is actually tougher than most metals, and fashioned this helm from one. Shame about the smell.", "一些有魄力的冒險者已經注意到了誇塞魔的皮膚其實比大多數金屬都要堅硬，這個頭盔就是一個誇塞魔的顱骨製成的。呣，氣味濃郁。", "_t")
t("Revenant", "亡魂", "entity name")
t("shifting breastplate", "不斷變形的胸甲", "_t")
t("The joints of this armor creak ominously, the frame bends and heaves, almost as if breathing. The scratch and crack of metal mutters of suffering, of loss, perseverance and revenge.", "關節不祥的咯吱作響，骨架彎曲突起的呼吸。劃痕與裂紋是金屬的低語，有關苦楚、失去、堅持與復仇。", "_t")
t("Status resistances shift over time to match the statuses you are being hit by.", "依據你中的負面狀態改變你的狀態免疫", "_t")
t("Imp Claw", "小鬼之爪", "entity name")
t("red, mottled claw", "紅色的爪子", "_t")
t("The battered remains of a flame imp's hand. It still burns with that unnatural flame.", "這是一隻火焰小鬼留下的滿是傷痕的爪子。它還燃燒着不自然的火焰。", "_t")
t("Wheel of Fate", "命運之輪", "entity name")
t([["This isn't what I wished for!" - Howar Muransk, Cornac demonologist.

This band of gothic obsidian menaces with an embossed image of a grinning skull. It beckons you to tempt fate and put it on. Do you?]], [[這不是我想要的結果！- 豪瓦爾·穆朗斯，科納克人惡魔使者。
獰笑着的骷髏圖案在這個由黑曜石鑄成的哥特式戒指上隱約浮現。骷髏似乎在召喚着你，使你情不自禁想要鋌而走險地把它戴在手上，轉動命運之輪。你會這麼做嗎？]], "_t")
t("strange black ring", "奇怪的黑色戒指", "_t")
t("#RED#The ring refuses to be removed!", "#RED#戒指拒絕被卸下！", "logPlayer")
t("Cannot be unequipped or rerolled until level %d.", "在達到等級%d之前，不能解除裝備和重置。", "tformat")
t("Can be unequipped, can't be rerolled.", "能解除裝備，不能重置", "_t")
t("Can be unequipped or rerolled.", "能解除裝備或重置", "_t")
t("re-generate the item with random stats. Can only be done three levels after the last reroll. Cannot be unequipped unless a reroll is available, or you are level 50", "重置戒指屬性。每3級能重置一次。除非有重置機會或者人物50級，否則不能解除裝備。", "_t")
t("#RED#The ring does not react.", "#RED#戒指沒有反應。", "logPlayer")
t("#CRIMSON#Your timetravel has no effect on pre-determined outcomes such as this.", "#CRIMSON#你的時間穿越對這種已經預設好的結局沒有任何作用。", "_t")
t("Wheel of Fate", "命運之輪", "_t")
t("#GREEN#The skull embossed in the ring twists around momentarily. ...Did it just laugh?", "#GREEN#戒指裏的頭骨似乎扭曲了一瞬間……它剛纔笑了麼？", "logPlayer")
t("Helm of the Dominated", "支配頭盔", "entity name")
t("horned helm", "長角的頭盔", "_t")
t("An experimental helmet designed to enhance the effects of the Doomelf corruption.", "這個頭盔是爲了提高魔化精靈的能力，而作爲實驗產品被製造出來。", "_t")
t("Increases the range of Haste of the Doomed by 1.", "增加種族技能“加速”的範圍1碼", "_t")
t("The Black Crown", "黑之冠", "entity name")
t("cracked obsidian crown", "破碎的黑曜石頭盔", "_t")
t("\"For the demon who has everything.\"", "魔中之魔，加冕爲王", "_t")
t("Increases all saves by your Shadow Power.", "每點“陰影強度”增加1點全豁免", "_t")
t("The Black Core", "黑之核", "entity name")
t("pitch black gemstone", "黑色的寶石", "_t")
t("\"Lock your soul away, and death will never reach you.\"", "鎖住靈魂，死亡莫及。", "_t")
t("Grants spellpower equal to your Shadow Power.", "每點“陰影強度”增加1點法術強度", "_t")
t("The Black Spike", "黑之釘", "entity name")
t("thin black sword", "很薄的黑色短劍", "_t")
t("\"All the better to pierce the heart of the world.\"", "世界之心，終將刺穿", "_t")
t("Increases all damage penetration by 1% for each point of your Shadow Power.", "每點“陰影強度”增加1%抗性穿透", "_t")
t("The Black Boots", "黑之靴", "entity name")
t("pair of pitch black boots", "黑色的靴子", "_t")
t("\"It's a treacherous road to the top of the world.\"", "背叛之路，直通天際", "_t")
t("Grants 2.5% movement speed for each point of Shadow Power.", "每點“陰影強度”增加2.5%移動速度", "_t")
t("The Black Ring", "黑之戒", "entity name")
t("obsidian ring", "黑曜石戒指", "_t")
t("\"An innocuous bauble. Until you look through the hole.\"", "勿視其中，安然無恙", "_t")
t("Grants spell-crit equal to half of your Shadow Power.", "每點“陰影強度”增加0.5%法術暴擊率", "_t")
