t("demon statue: Ruin Banshee", "惡魔雕像：毀滅女妖", "_t")
t("The onslaught of the Sher'Tul portals never truly stopped.  Magic still pours from them, threatening to do even more damage to our home; it would be completely destroyed by now, if not for our Father.  Part of his work to keep Mal'Rok structurally intact is to blow great gusts across the devastated land, forcing the ravenous flames back into the portal network from whence they came.  It would seem, though, that the flames took souvenirs with them; our scouting parties have noted that Sher'Tul portals on Eyal, even those which have been completely deactivated, will occasionally emit a shade of one of our fallen citizens, imbued by some of Urh'Rok's power, smelling of Mal'Rok's ashes, and warped to insanity by its transit through the unstable rifts.  While this is a troubling revalation of the true horror of the Sher'Tul weapons, telling us that even now our fallen cannot rest in peace, the fact that they are arriving on Eyal in defiance of the shield is some consolation, as it means that those most wronged by the betrayal can claim their revenge personally.", [[夏·圖爾傳送門的影響從未停止。直到現在，奧術能量仍然在從中向外散溢而出，威脅着對我們的故鄉做出更大的破壞；如果不是我們父親大人的能力，恐怕我們的故鄉早已經被其完全毀壞。他保持瑪·洛克結構穩定的一個重要過程是在荒蕪的土地上吹起狂暴的怒風，將飢渴的熱焰吹回傳送門的網絡之中。然而，我們發現，這些烈火即使走時也要從我們的故鄉掠奪些東西才肯返回。我們的埃亞爾探險隊記錄了在埃亞爾發現的夏·圖爾傳送門附近經常徘徊着我們犧牲同胞的靈魂——即使是那些已經關閉的傳送門也不例外。他們被烏魯洛克的力量所浸染，被瑪·洛克的灰燼所環繞，在穿梭時空裂縫的過程中被折磨地幾近瘋狂。這昭示着有關夏·圖爾人邪惡武器的恐怖力量，告訴我們即使是那些逝者在他們的折磨下也不得安眠。然而，他們繞過環繞埃亞爾的護盾到達星球表面的事實也給我們帶來了些許慰藉，這些在夏·圖爾人陰毒背叛的慘劇中受害的無辜者終於有機會親自復仇了。
]], "_t")
t("demon statue: Draebor, the Imp", "惡魔雕像：小惡魔德瑞寶", "_t")
t("Teleportation is one of the most crucial areas of magical research to our cause of revenge; until we break the Sher'Tul-made shield surrounding Eyal, it will remain our only means of reaching the surface.  One of our leading scholars, a child of onyx known as Draebor, has perfected short-range teleportation and has been studying methods to work his skills into a mass-producible artifact to grant this ability to all of our troops.  He's kept his work under wraps as of late, but rumor has it that he's been reverse-engineering the Sher'Tul portals, letting our invasion get through via their own weapons.  Whatever he's up to, keep an eye out - big things are just around the corner, courtesy of his dedicated research!", [[傳送術是完成我們復仇行動的重要研究領域。在我們打破圍繞埃亞爾大陸的夏·圖爾之盾之前，傳送術將是我們達到大陸表面唯一的手段。我們的領軍學者之一—縞瑪瑙之子德瑞寶——掌握着完美的短距傳送術，並且一直在研究方案將他的技術融入工藝品並量產化，使我們的軍隊都具備這樣的能力。他一直將研究的進程保密，但是有謠言說他正在反向驅動夏·圖爾的傳送門，讓我們通過夏·圖爾的武器發動侵略。無論他做到哪一步，我們都要拭目以待——多虧了他的專注的研究，即將有重大的事件發生！
]], "_t")
t("demon statue: Shasshhiy'Kaish", "惡魔雕像:莎西凱希", "_t")
t([[Once a naturalist and explorer, this scholar frequently made trips to Eyal in the period before Mal'Rok's destruction.  Her journals about a wide assortment of curious species living in the shadow of the Sher'Tul were a delightful read for our citizens, and she had a genuine love for these pitiable, uncivilized creatures.  She, along with two of her companions, were trapped on Eyal when the portal network was destroyed; for a long time, she was feared dead, or worse, turned traitor and working with the natives against her old home.  In any case, it was assumed she would have expired of old age by the time we arrived in orbit around the planet.  Once we got there, though, something curious happened: by magic we still haven't been able to reverse-engineer, a handful of Eyalites dressed in strange robes appeared on our continent, proclaiming devotion to Shasshhiy'Kaish and wishing to be subjected to our experiments.  Ever since then, batches of these willing captives have been delivered with great regularity.  Sadly, they have not been as great a boon to our research as this would sound - all of them appear with nearly every shred of their essence drained, leaving them on the edge of death, and that's not counting the frequent cases of internal bleeding and the rare occasion of them appearing with a rewired nervous system that perceives pain as pleasure, frustrating our attempts to create better methods of punishment.  Nonetheless, they are both cooperative and plentiful, and have been quite helpful.  We cannot be sure that Shasshhiy'Kaish herself is still alive, but if she is, we can be sure her allegiances are with our cause.

#{italic}#A short message is etched below the main text.#{normal}#

Cute.  I'll let it stay.  
-S.
]], [[作爲一名博物學者和探險家，這位學者經常在瑪·洛克毀滅前的日子裏到埃亞爾大陸旅行。她在旅行日誌中記載了棲息於夏·圖爾人陰影中種類繁多的神奇生物，我們的市民們都樂於閱讀這些作品。她對這些卑劣、未開化的生物有一種由衷的熱愛。當傳送門網絡被摧毀的時候，她和另外兩名同伴被困於埃亞爾大陸。很長一段時間裏，大家都擔心她死了，或者更糟——成爲一名叛徒並與埃亞爾的居民們一同反抗他的家鄉。不管哪種情況，當我們進入這顆星球的軌道時，她應當已經死於衰老。當我們到達那裏時，意想不到的事發生了：當我們還不能反向傳送的時候，一些穿着奇怪長袍的埃亞爾人在我們的大陸上出現，這些人聲稱忠於莎西·凱希，並願爲我們的實驗獻身。從那以後，一批又一批類似的志願俘虜被傳送了過來。可惜的是，這些人對實驗並沒有帶來想象中的幫助——他們的每一絲生命精華已被汲取殆盡，陷於死亡邊緣。這還沒有算上常見的體內出血的情況，又或者是神經網絡重接導致他們將痛苦視爲快樂的情況，這讓我們開發更好懲罰手段的努力無功而返。不過，總的來說他們既合作又數量充足，並且很有幫助。我們不確定莎西·凱希是否還存活。如果她還活着，我們相信她的忠誠與我們同在。

#{italic}#在主要文字的下面蝕刻着一條簡短的信息。#{normal}#

真可愛。我準備留下這些文字。

—S.
]], "_t")
t("demon statue: Walrog", "惡魔雕像:烏爾羅格", "_t")
t([[#{italic}#The message at the base of this statue has been scratched out, and a new one has been carved in its place.#{normal}#

Walrog, if you're reading this: We're still alive, but keep up the good work.
-S.]], [[#{italic}#這座雕像底座上原有的文字已經被刮掉，一行新的留言取代了它的位置。#{normal}#

烏爾羅格，如果你看到這個：說明我們還活着，並且還在努力實現我們的目標。
—S.
]], "_t")
t("demon statue: Kryl-Feijan", "惡魔雕像:卡洛·斐濟", "_t")
t([[#{italic}#The text at the base of this statue has been scratched out.  A note is attached in its place.#{normal}#

Hello, Eyalite.  The text here wouldn't have meant a whole lot to you; a whole lot of blathering about his accomplishments as a naturalist, and his mysterious disappearance.  Let me tell you what you need to know instead.

Kryl-Feijan was my lover, and along with a friend by the name of Walrog we came to Eyal out of curiosity and thirst for knowledge.  It was an enlightening hobby, and the reports we made of your many, primitive species were read all across our world.  Do not think you deserved this attention; you were not special in any way aside from your inferiority.  How could the planet of the powerful, intelligent Sher'Tul create such savages that had barely escaped feudalism?  Your sins were endearing, and your failures amusing.  And it was knowing this, along with the curious absence of the Sher'Tul, that led us to go out and investigate when a wounded child of onyx came through our portal, deactivated it, and told us of horrible destruction unleashed on Mal'Rok by Eyal.  We knew you were not capable of such feats, so we had to learn the answers for ourselves; Kryl-Feijan and I adopted our usual disguises as human mages, while Walrog arranged to scout the seas for anomalies, then meet us back after a few days.

When we emerged from our underground lodge, we were surprised to see firestorms (although not nearly so fierce) raging across Eyal as well.  What surprised us more, though, was an enraged horde of peasants, provoked by our unfortunate choice of disguises - in your ignorance, you chose to blame spellcasters for the disaster.  We tried to escape, but the mob swarmed us from all directions, and were soon upon us.

Soon, I was tied up and restrained, while they gloated and made threats I couldn't hear over the din of the crowd.  I could have fought back, but I kept telling myself only to lash out once I was sure my life was in danger, reassuring myself that the people of Eyal who were once so fascinating to me surely couldn't be aware of what they were doing.  Judging from the geysers of flame bursting above my head, my lover was not so patient; when the blasts stopped and the crowd started to clear away, I saw why he'd fought so fiercely.  His injuries were horrific, clearly done to make him suffer rather than incapacitate him, and he was on the edge of death.  In a moment of desperation, I muttered a spell to myself to understand what was going through their minds, what could possibly justify such treatment.  That's when I learned what they'd done to him, and what they were planning with me, but neither was as awful as the unthinking hate motivating it...  there are both too many words for it and not enough.  Horrible, barbaric, sadistic, all are accurate but none fully convey the evil of it.  That moment is when I learned the true savagery of Eyal, and realized the fate all Eyalites deserve.  That moment is when my patience broke.

There is a type of magic on Mal'Rok that will allow one to transfer his or her life-essence to another, prolonging the latter's lifespan at the expense of the former.  Voluntary donations to honored figures are popular, but the reverse - draining another to help one's self - was considered the gravest of sins, a statement that you considered your life to be worth more than another's, which is a decision nobody should be allowed to make when they have a vested interest in it.  Walrog had taught this forbidden spell to me, and only now did I use it, withering the horde all at once and forcing their lives into Kryl-Feijan.  The survivors, too weak to stand up against me, suffered greatly, playthings of my brief and furious revenge.  Unfortunately, even all the life I'd drained was not quite enough to restore my lover to health; all it could do was keep him in limbo, in incredible pain and unable to act, but still alive.

I took his surviving essence and fled to safety, then started picking the natives off one by one, extending my lifespan and getting ever closer to restoring him to health.  I can only assume Walrog is doing the same, preying on sailors first and then naga; I've lost contact with him, but the stories of terrors from the sea tell me he's still alive.  Keeping Kryl-Feijan in limbo consumes a great deal of energy, though, and soon lone travellers were not enough to keep him stable; I needed others to work for me, gathering victims and willingly sacrificing themselves once they'd outlived their usefulness.  And that is when I learned of the approach of the Fearscape, and came up with an offer I could make to the residents of Eyal.

When the legions of Urh'Rok manage to get an invasion force to Eyal's surface - not if, but when - you will all suffer, more than you can possibly imagine.  Many of you will die; some will not be so lucky, and will be an ever-living target of their rage, tortured until the end of time.  Their reasons are somewhat inaccurate, but make no mistake: you deserve the fate they have lined up for you.  Even if I wanted to, neither I nor anything else in the universe could stop their invasion, save the word of Urh'Rok himself - and that seems rather unlikely.  If you assist me and follow my orders to my satisfaction, I can guarantee you two things.  One, your inevitable agonizing fate WILL end in death, after a maximum of a couple of weeks; even the armies of Mal'Rok can't undo the effects of having your life-essence drained.  And two, before you feel the pain, you will feel nearly-equal pleasure.  With my magical skills, I can alter myself into any form, create all manner of illusions, and manipulate all your senses to your liking.  Your wildest, most unrealistic fantasies will become true; the time before the pain starts will be so enjoyable as to eclipse every moment of your pathetic lives that came before.  And if you think yourself above such hedonism, consider the psionically-gifted servitors I've recently acquired, and the way they could change your memories - when the "demons" are dripping acid into your eyes, then growing them back with more nerve endings than before so you can feel the pain more acutely, won't it be much more bearable if you're under the delusion that you've made a selfless sacrifice to save Eyal, and that your children and loved ones aren't suffering the same fate?

Countless others have agreed to this deal in the millenia before you were even born, and I have amassed enough essence to contain Kryl-Feijan in a stable "seed."  Once it is planted in a suitable victim and allowed to grow, he will once again walk Eyal, far more powerful than he was before, and the two of us will do everything we can to speed up your miserable world's much-deserved death.  Technically, any sentient and fleshy body would work, but I'd like someone who'll be missed, whose death will allow my lover's first act in rebirth to cause great misery to Eyal.  If you'd like to accept my deal, come unarmed and alone to the Crypt of Kryl-Feijan, and join your fellow Eyalites in servitude to me.  And if you were to bring a suitable host for my lover...  well, that'd be deserving of some special, one-on-one attention, wouldn't it?

Eyal is doomed to perish in screaming agony.  Wouldn't you at least like a good-bye kiss first?

-S.]], [[#{italic}#這座雕像底座上原有的文字已經被刮掉，一段筆記被留在了那裏。#{normal}#

你好，埃亞爾人。這裏原本的文字對你們來說並不重要：只不過是一個博物學者喋喋不休地講述他的成就和謎一般的失蹤。我來講一些你們應當知道的東西。

卡洛·斐濟是我的愛人。出於好奇和對知識的渴望，我們與一位朋友——烏爾羅格——來到了埃亞爾大陸。這個愛好帶給我們很多啓發，我們撰寫的關於埃亞爾大陸原始物種的報告，在我們的世界被廣泛傳閱。別以爲你們值得這樣的注意；除了劣等，你們別無其他特質。孕育了強大，聰慧的夏·圖爾人的這顆行星是怎麼創造你們這樣還沒脫離封建社會的野蠻人的？你們的罪孽讓人欣喜，你們的失敗令人發笑。正是因爲這，再加上夏·圖爾人的神祕失蹤，當那名受傷的縞瑪瑙之子穿過並關閉了我們的傳送門，告訴我們埃亞爾大陸給瑪·洛克帶來了可怕的毀滅時，我們立刻知道你們沒能力實現這樣的壯舉。所以我們決定親自出發尋找事件的真相。卡洛·斐濟和我像往常一樣變裝爲人類法師，烏爾羅格則在海上搜尋異常，並在幾天後與我們會面。

從地底的居所出發後，我們驚訝的發現火焰風暴（儘管沒那麼猛烈）也在埃亞爾大陸肆虐。更令我們吃驚的是大量的無知難民，將這一切歸罪於魔法師。我們的僞裝正好激怒了他們。我們試圖從暴民中脫身，但是人羣蜂擁而至，最後控制了我們。

很快，我就被綁起來，他們滿意地看着我們，並且發出種種威脅，然而嘈雜的人聲淹沒了他的聲音，我沒能聽清楚。我本可以反擊，然而我一直忍耐，想着只要在真正有性命之虞的時候抽身逃走就行，不停地勸慰自己，那些曾經對我來說多麼吸引人的埃亞爾住民們根本不知道他們在做什麼。然而，一連串在我頭上爆炸的火焰顯示出我的愛人顯然沒有那麼耐心。當爆炸平息，人羣散開的時候，我終於知道他爲什麼如此兇猛地反擊了。他受了很嚴重的傷，明顯是爲了讓他受苦而不是限制他的行動，他就快死了。在一瞬的絕望之後，我低聲念出了咒語，讀取了他們的思想，瞭解他們爲什麼如此對待我的愛人。於是我知道了他們對我的愛人做了什麼，以及他們將要對我做些什麼，更可怕的是支配他們行動的那不假思索的憎恨……有很多詞可以用來形容，可憎的、野蠻的、虐待狂的，都很準確，但是卻無法描述那其中的邪惡。正是在那時，我瞭解了埃亞爾的野蠻，以及所有埃亞爾人應得的命運。同時，我的忍耐已經突破了極限。

瑪·洛克的世界裏有這樣一種魔法，它可以讓一個人把他的生命精華轉移給另一個人，以前者的生命爲代價，延長後者的壽命。對受人尊敬的名人志願奉獻生命很常見，但是反之——汲取別人的生命來幫助自己——被認爲是最嚴重的罪行。這等同於宣稱你的生命比其他人的更有價值。當人們能從中獲得利益的時候，這樣的權衡是不被允許的。烏爾羅格曾將這個禁咒傳授給我，也只有在那時我使用了這個咒語，使暴民們的生命全部枯萎，並將它們轉移到卡洛·斐濟體內。即使是倖存的暴民，也承受了巨大的痛苦，搖搖欲墜，成爲了我疾風暴雨般復仇的犧牲品。不幸的是，我汲取來的所有生命也不足以讓我的愛人恢復健康，僅僅能讓他在地獄門前徘徊，忍受着無盡的痛苦，喪失行動的能力，苟延殘喘。

我帶着他僅存的精華逃跑到安全的地方，然後開始一個接一個的奪走埃亞爾人的精華，延長我的壽命，並儘可能的讓他恢復健康。我猜想烏爾羅格也在這麼做，捕食水手，然後是娜迦。我們失去了聯繫，但是一些海上的恐怖傳說讓我相信他還活着。維持卡洛·斐濟的生存消耗了許多能量，再過不久，獨行的旅人已經不足以使他的狀況穩定。我需要其他人爲我工作，收集犧牲品，並在物盡其用之後奉獻生命。那時我學會了進入恐懼空間，並且想出了一個給埃亞爾人的提議。

總有一天，烏魯洛克的軍團將對埃亞爾展開侵略。你們都會遭受難以想象的痛苦。你們許多人都會死去。當然不是所有人都這麼幸運，剩下那些會成爲他們無盡狂怒的靶子，他們會一直折磨你直到時間的盡頭。他們的理由是——或許不準確，但是我沒有說錯——“他們所安排的命運是你們應得的”。我或者宇宙中任何事物都沒法阻止他們的侵略，儘管我很想這麼做。恐怕只有烏魯洛克本人可以拯救這個世界——這看起來也不太現實。如果你們能幫助我，並且服從我的命令，讓我感到滿意，我可以保證你們兩件事：第一，你無法避免的可悲命運將會以死亡終結，最多隻要幾周的時間，哪怕烏魯洛克的軍隊也無法在我汲取你們的生命精華之後撤銷這個行動。第二，在你們感到痛苦之前，你們會感到等量的快樂。通過魔法，我可以讓自己變成各種形態，生成各種各樣的幻想，按你們的喜好操縱你們的感官。你們最瘋狂最不現實的夢想將會成真。等待痛苦到來的時間將會變得令人愉悅，讓你的之前的人生黯然失色。如果你們覺得不屑於這種享樂主義，那麼我最近招納的有心靈能力方面天賦的僕從值得考慮，他們可以改變你們的記憶。當“惡魔們”將酸液滴入你的眼球，再將它放回神經更加密集的地方去，於是你會感到更加劇烈的痛苦。如果這時，你產生了你在爲拯救埃亞爾大陸而無私的奉獻生命，並且你的愛人孩子不會承受如此痛苦的幻覺，你會不會感覺這一切更加容易忍耐了呢。

在你們誕生千年之前，數不清的其他人已經接受了這個提議，我積累了足夠的精華將卡洛·斐濟保存在一個穩定的“種子”之中。一旦將它種在合適的犧牲品之中放任生長，他將以更加強大的姿態重返埃亞爾大陸。我們兩人將會用盡所有手段來加速你們可悲世界的應得的末日。理論上，任何有靈性的血肉之軀都可以作爲種子的容器。但是我想要一個會被懷念的人，殺死他可以讓我愛人重生的第一步給這個世界帶來巨大的不幸。如果你接受我的提議，就卸下武裝隻身前往卡洛·斐濟的地窖，與你的埃亞爾同胞一起爲我效勞。如果你能給我的愛人帶來一個合適的容器……很好，那將會得到某種特殊的、一對一的照顧，怎麼樣？

埃亞爾註定在痛苦的尖叫中滅亡。你們不想先來個告別之吻嗎？

—S.
]], "_t")
t("demon statue: Khulmanar, General of Urh'Rok", "惡魔雕像:庫馬納·魯洛克之近衛將軍", "_t")
t("Our tournaments, run ever since our salvation from the dust mages under the command and inspiration of Urh'Rok, are not simply tests of direct combat, as many may think.  We have those, yes, but we also have competitions for scholarly work, attentiveness, physical endurance, philosophy, and countless other fields.  Perhaps the most prestigious of these, though, is the Divine Tournament of Tactics, by which our military leaders are selected.  Through a series of trials, we are compared in our abilities to assess a combat scenario and swiftly handle it, rated on speed, casualties, deployment efficiency, and a variety of other factors.  Khulmanar, a child of onyx, is the reigning champion of these, and has been for most of the time that we've spent waiting for our continent to reach Eyal.  Chosen by our process as the wisest tactical mind among our people, he was selected to meet with Urh'Rok himself to gain his approval to lead our forces in the invasion.  Urh'Rok was so impressed by Khulmanar that he used a significant portion of the little energy he's not using to hold our world together to build Khulmanar a new body, one strong enough to let him direct battles from the front-line without fear.  With a form and weapons granted by our Father, and a mind given his direct, enthusiastic approval, Khulmanar is considered to be the avatar of Urh'Rok, and his commands in battle are to be treated with the same reverence we would give to the words of Father himself.", [[自從我們被從塵埃法師的控制之下解放後，在烏爾洛克的命令和鼓動下，我們開始舉辦錦標賽。這個比賽，不像很多人想的那樣，僅僅是爲了測試直接的戰鬥。除此之外我們還有學術工作、專注、物理耐受、哲學等諸多其他領域的競賽。或許，這其中最著名的當屬神聖戰術競標賽，我們的軍事領導人正是通過這個賽事選拔出來的。比賽包括一系列試煉，評估我們對戰況進行分析和處理的能力，包括速度、傷亡、部署效率以及一些其他的因素。庫馬納，縞瑪瑙之子，是這些項目的冠軍，並且在等待我們的大陸到達埃亞爾的大部分時間裏，他都維持了統治地位。通過我們競賽所篩選出的最傑出的戰略大師，庫馬納被烏魯洛克親自召見以獲准統御我們的入侵部隊。庫馬納給烏魯洛克留下了很深的印象，於是後者從他維持我們世界的力量以外的部分中抽取了很大一部分，爲庫馬納創造了一個全新的肉身，讓他能夠在前線無所畏懼的指引戰鬥。擁有我們的父所賜予的武器與軀殼，精神受到父的指引，庫馬納被視作烏魯洛克的化身，他在戰場上的指令受到如同父一般的尊敬。

]], "_t")
t("demon statue: Lithfengel", "惡魔雕像:里斯豐格", "_t")
t("Lithfengel, mentor of Draebor and child of emerald, was one of our finest scholars.  When most of us were still too afraid to go near a portal, he recovered an intact one and began to pry apart its secrets, in hopes of reaching Eyal.  His data showed that although this portal was still technically connected to Eyal, the link between the two worlds was still fluctuating far too much to make it safe for travel, the still-raging flames threatening to tear any prospective passengers apart before they reached their destination.  Rather than try to repair the link directly, he went into his lab and didn't emerge for a few days; when he came out, he glowed with a strange new enchantment, proclaiming it would adaptively mutate him to endure whatever damage the portal would otherwise inflict.  Saying that the consequences of failure were too awful to risk inflicting on other test subjects, he entered the portal himself, promising to return immediately after he arrived; he has not been seen since.  May he rest in peace for his selfless devotion.", [[里斯豐格，小惡魔德瑞寶的導師，綠翡翠之子，是最傑出的學者之一。當我們大部分人還畏懼接近傳送門的時候，他早已找到了一個未被人使用過的，並且開始窺探其中的祕密，希望能夠達到埃亞爾。他的數據顯示，儘管這個傳送門與埃亞爾連接，但是兩個世界之間的波動使得前往另一個世界的旅行太過危險，肆虐的火焰會在你到達目的之前將你撕碎。比起直接修復連接，里斯豐格躲入他的實驗室裏好幾天。當他出來的時候，他興奮地帶着一個奇怪的新式符咒，宣稱這個符咒將會使他產生突變來抵禦傳送門將會造成的任何傷害。由於他說實施其他實驗的失敗後果太過危險，他獨自一人進入了傳送門，並且承諾在到達之後會立即返回，從那以後再也沒有人見到他。看在他無私奉獻的份上，願他能夠安息。

]], "_t")
t("demon statue: Rogroth, Eater of Souls", "惡魔雕像：羅格洛斯·靈魂吞噬者", "_t")
t("Recently, the cultists of Shasshhiy'Kaish have begun speaking of a \"demon seed,\" a sort of magical cluster of life-essence which can be implanted in a sentient being, allowing it to grow inside of them and eventually become one of our citizens.  Inspired by this idea, the children of emerald have developed a prototype of this form of magic, and the children of onyx have made a chassis to carry it into combat.  Rogroth generates countless essence-less seeds from within its frame, then embeds them in nearby living beings, so when they expire, their life-essence goes directly into the seed and allows it to grow.  We have not yet perfected its production capabilities, so currently the seeds will only become degenerate husks when they grow, but fear not!  As we get data from the tests of this design, we'll improve on it, and soon the slaughter of our foes will cause wretchlings, quasits, and even thaurheregs to spring up from their corpses.  With a little bit of luck and some decisive early skirmishes, we could even bypass the problem of getting an invasion force to the surface entirely, growing it there instead.", [[最近，莎西·凱希的教徒們開始談論起“惡魔種子”。這是一串具有魔力的生命精華，可以被植入有靈性的生物中，並在其中發育爲我們的公民。在這個傳說的啓發下，綠翡翠之子研究出了這種魔法的原形，縞瑪瑙之子製造了能夠將其應用於戰鬥的基座。洛格羅斯在這個構造中留下了無數沒有精華的種子，並將這些種子嵌入附近的生物中，當這些生物死去，他們的生命精華將會流入並滋長這些種子。我們還沒有完善的生產能力，所以目前這些種子只會成長爲退化的空殼。但是別擔心！隨着我們獲取相關的數據，我們將會改進它。不久的將來，當殺死我們的敵人後，酸液樹魔、誇塞魔，甚至是修爾希瑞格將會從他們的屍體中誕生。只需要早期的小規模戰鬥，加上一點好運，我們可以在埃亞爾生產我們的入侵部隊，直接傳送部隊的難題就這麼被繞過了。
]], "_t")
t("demon statue: Corrupted Daelach", "惡魔雕像：墮落達萊奇", "_t")
t("One of the problems with making daelach is the inherent instability that comes from creating something that is almost entirely made of magic.  If ambient levels of blight are even slightly too high, it can set off a chain reaction that at best destroys the daelach, and at worst destroys most of the mages who were building it.  Daelach production is thus theoretically cheap, but in practice involves great expense, and usually a blighted daelach has to be immediately put down lest it cause tremendous damage.  One specimen, though, adapted to the blight in a very interesting way, sprouting wings and bolstering its usual firestorms with blight, but otherwise remaining perfectly balanced and controllable.  We'll try to recreate this happy accident however we can, but in the meantime, it will prove effective on the surface of Eyal.", [[製造達萊奇的問題之一就是創造純粹魔法生物所固有的不穩定性。如果周邊的枯萎水平哪怕高那麼一點點，也會導致連鎖反應，輕則摧毀達萊奇，重則會殺死大部分負責製造達萊奇的法師。因此製造達萊奇的理論成本很低廉，但是實際上會帶來巨大的費用。而且，一個枯萎化的達萊奇必須立刻被壓制，以免它造成巨大的損害。不過，有一個樣本用一種有趣的方式進行了枯萎化，它長出了翅膀，並用枯萎能量強化了他的火焰風暴，另一方面它維持了平衡與可控性。我們將會用盡所有辦法嘗試重現這個令人驚喜的意外，與此同時，它會前往埃亞爾大陸證明他的實際效果。
]], "_t")
t("demon statue: Harkor'Zun", "惡魔雕像：哈卡祖", "_t")
t("Of the anomalies and phenomena we've noticed in our studies of the shield protecting Eyal, none have frustrated us so much as meteors.  Certain powerful Eyalite spellcasters can pull a large meteor into low orbit, passing it through the shield relatively unharmed, aside from being split into predictably-sized chunks, which are then called to the surface one-by-one in a series of devastating meteoric crashes.  While we have not yet found a way to reverse-engineer these spells to protect our standard troops from disintegration, we have had some limited success in making a construct that closely resembles a meteor in composition and appearance.  Harkor'Zun, a being made mostly of stone, was simply dropped from our platform; the shield shattered him as expected, but we had designed him to survive this, the fragments merging back into their completed form once he reached the surface.  It would seem, though, that either we made him to be too sturdy, or the shield envelops incoming objects in a sort of anti-magic coating, as he has been unable to start the second stage of this process, wherein he merges these fragments back into a completed form.  Should an Eyalite stumble upon him and attempt to destroy the fragments, Harkor'Zun will be able to re-combine and \"thank\" whoever granted him his ascension.", [[在我們對守護埃亞爾之盾的研究所發現的規律與異常現象之中，沒有一個像流星這樣讓我們沮喪。一些強大的埃亞爾法師可以將大型的流星拖入低空軌道，在幾乎沒有損傷的情況下使它通過護盾，唯一的損傷是隕石被分割成若干大塊，然後被依次召喚到地表造成毀滅性的隕石撞擊。我們還不沒有找到反制這些咒語的方法來保護我們的軍隊免於潰散。我們唯一獲得的成功就是製造出了在成分和外觀上都類似隕石的物體。哈卡祖，大部分由石頭構成的生物，被我們從我們的平臺上丟下。如同想象的那樣，護盾將它撕得粉碎，不過我們的設計讓它能夠得以生存。碎片在到達埃亞爾之後重新融合到一起，組成完整形態。然而，或許是因爲我們將它製造的太過頑固，又或許是護盾將侵入的物體包裹上反魔法的外衣，哈卡祖無法進行第二階段——將碎片重組的階段。如果哪個埃亞爾人無腦的試圖摧毀它，哈卡祖將會進行重組，然後給予幫助它重組的人“重重的答謝”。
]], "_t")

------------------------------------------------
section "tome-ashes-urhrok/data/quests/re-abducted.lua"

t("I've a feeling we're not on Eyal anymore", "我感覺我已不在埃亞爾大陸", "_t")
t([[Somehow you did not recall out as usual but instead ended up on a sadly familiar area.
You are back in the Fearscape. Back and with a welcome committee.

You must find a way to escape, again.

]], [[不知怎的，你並沒有像往常一樣回城，而是到了一片令人沮喪的熟悉的地方。
你又回到了惡魔空間，同時面臨着一羣熱情的迎接者們。

你必須要逃離，再一次。

]], "_t")
t("#LIGHT_GREEN#* You have found your way out of the primary ambush.#WHITE#", "#LIGHT_GREEN#* 你找到擺脫面前伏擊的方法。#WHITE#", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_GREEN#* You have destroyed Rogroth the Eater of Souls and made your escape possible. Flee!#WHITE#", "#LIGHT_GREEN#* 你已經消滅了羅格洛斯靈魂吞噬者，趁現在趕快逃！#WHITE#", "_t")
t("#SLATE#* Find a way back to Eyal.#WHITE#", "#SLATE#* 尋找回到埃亞爾大陸的路。#WHITE#", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_GREEN#* You have escaped the Anteroom of Agony.#WHITE#", "#LIGHT_GREEN#* 你成功地再一次逃離惡魔。#WHITE#", "_t")
-- untranslated text
--[==[
t("#LIGHT_GREEN#* #WHITE#", "#LIGHT_GREEN#* #WHITE#", "_t")
--]==]


------------------------------------------------
section "tome-ashes-urhrok/data/quests/start-ashes.lua"

t("Ashes in the Wind", "風中灰", "_t")
t([[You do not remember much of your life before you were on this burning continent, floating in the void between worlds.  You have been helping demons, happily participating in their experiments to shatter some sort of shield preventing them from taking their righteous revenge on Eyal.

You are being taken by your handler to the torture-pits to help them figure out how to cause the most pain to those on Eyal, when you hear a roaring above you; you look up and see a burning meteor, flying closer, and the demons' spells failing to divert its course!  It lands near you, knocking you off your feet with its shockwave and killing your handler instantly.

As you recover, and your platform of searing earth splits from the main continent, your old memories flood your mind and you come to your senses - the demons are out to destroy your home!  You must escape... but not without destroying the crystal they've used to keep track of you.
]], [[你已經不太記得來到這片漂浮在虛空中的燃燒大陸之前的記憶了。你曾經幫助過惡魔，歡欣着參與他們的實驗，以打破某種阻止惡魔降臨大舉復仇入侵埃亞爾的無形屏障。

你被你的'主人'帶到這裏以幫助研究如何對埃亞爾大陸  造成更嚴重的傷害，突然一陣轟鳴從天上傳來，你擡頭，看見一顆燃燒着的隕石正在墜落。惡魔試圖用法術將其粉碎，但沒有成功！它落在你身邊，砸死了你的 '主人' ，同時你也被砸暈在地。

當你醒來後，你發現你身處一個和主大陸分離的平臺，而你舊時的記憶漸漸涌來。你立刻驚醒——惡魔們要毀滅你的故鄉！你必須逃離……同時別忘了摧毀他們用以追蹤你的水晶體。
]], "_t")
t("#LIGHT_GREEN#* You have destroyed the controlling crystal. The demons can no track you down anymore.#WHITE#", "#LIGHT_GREEN#* 你摧毀了控制水晶，惡魔們不能再追蹤你了。#WHITE#", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_GREEN#* You have destroyed the Planar Controller. Flee now!#WHITE#", "#LIGHT_GREEN#* 你摧毀了空間控制者。趁現在逃跑吧！#WHITE#", "_t")
t("#SLATE#* You have to destroy the Planar Controller to escape.#WHITE#", "#SLATE#* 想要逃跑，你必須摧毀空間控制者。#WHITE#", "_t")
t("#SLATE#* You have to destroy the controlling crystal before leaving or the demons will be able to track you down.#WHITE#", "#SLATE#* 你必須在逃跑前摧毀控制水晶，否則惡魔能利用那個東西追蹤你。#WHITE#", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
section "tome-ashes-urhrok/data/talents/corruptions/black-magic.lua"

t("Bleak Outcome", "悲慘結局", "talent name")
t([[Your actions foreshadow a bleak outcome for your foes.
		Each time you deal darkness, fire, blight or acid damage you curse your foe with an effect that stacks up to %d times (this can happen only once per creature per turn).
		The vim you get for killing the creature is increased by 100%% for every stack of Bleak Outcome.
		The vim's worth of a creature depends on your Willpower.]], [[你的一舉一動都是敵人悲慘結局的預兆。
		每次你造成暗影、火焰、枯萎或酸性傷害時，你詛咒你的目標，最多疊加至 %d 次（每個敵人每回合最多觸發一次）。
		每有一層詛咒，你殺死被詛咒目標時獲得的活力值增加 100%% 。
		獲得活力值基礎值取決於意志。]], "tformat")
t("Weakened Soul", "靈魂弱化", "talent name")
t("For each stack of Bleak Outcome up to %d the afflicted creatures are weakened, reducing their resistances by 2%%.", "你施加的每層悲慘結局效果，將會影響最多 %d 個生物，使其抗性降低2%%。", "tformat")
t("Grim Future", "無情未來", "talent name")
t([[The future looks grim indeed... for your foes.
		You can target a creature affected by Bleak Outcome to consume up to %s stacks, dealing %0.2f darkness damage to it for every stack and increasing your Spellpower by 4 per stacks for 6 turns.
		While powered-up you can not apply new Bleak Outcome stacks.		
		Damage is based on your Spellpower.]], [[對你的敵人來說，未來非常無情。
		你可以指定一個被悲慘結局影響的生物，消耗 %s 層疊加效果，每層造成 %0.2f 暗影傷害，並每層強化你法術強度 4 點，持續 6 回合。
		當你處於強化狀態下，無法施加新的悲慘結局效果。
		傷害受法術強度加成。]], "tformat")
t("Ominous Shadow", "不祥黑影", "talent name")
t([[By gorging yourself on up to %d stacks of Bleak Outcome from a creature, you turn into an Ominous Shadow for one turn per stack.
		While transformed you are invisible (power %d), convert 100%% of all damage done to darkness and gain darkness resistance penetration and damage increase equal to your highest.
		While transformed you can not apply new Bleak Outcome stacks.]], [[你吞噬一個生物身上最多 %d 層悲慘結局效果，使自己化爲不祥黑影，每層持續 1 回合。
		不祥黑影狀態下你處於隱形（強度 %d ）造成的所有傷害轉化爲暗影傷害，並獲得相當於你最高傷害加成和抗性穿透的暗影傷害加成和抗性穿透。
		在變身狀態下，無法施加新的悲慘結局效果。]], "tformat")

------------------------------------------------
section "tome-ashes-urhrok/data/talents/corruptions/brutality.lua"

t("Draining Assault", "汲魂痛擊", "talent name")
t("You require a two handed weapon to use this talent.", "你需要裝備一把雙手武器來施展這個技能。", "logPlayer")
t("Hits the target twice, doing %d%% weapon damage each hit. You gain life equal to %d%% of the damage dealt, and you gain %d vim for each attack that hits.", "對目標攻擊兩次，每次造成 %d%% 武器傷害 , 吸取 %d%% 的傷害回覆生命，同時每次擊中均回覆 %d 活力。", "tformat")
t("Fiery Grasp", "炙炎之牢", "talent name")
t("%s resists the silence!", "%s抵抗了沉默！", "logSeen")
t("%s resists the grasp!", "%s 抵抗了抓取!", "logSeen")
t([[Send out a claw of fire, striking in a line doing %0.2f damage leading to a target. The target is caught in the claw's grasp, taking %d%% weapon damage as fire damage and becoming unable to move for %d turns, while also taking %0.2f damage per turn.
		Starting from talent level 4, it will also silence.
		The beam damage and damage over time will increase with your Spellpower.]], [[對目標伸出一隻火炎之爪，對直線上的生物造成 %0.2f 點火焰傷害。目標被火炎之爪抓住後，受到 %d%% 火焰武器傷害，並在 %d 回合不能移動，同時每回合受到 %0.2f 點火焰傷害。
	技能等級 4 級以後，目標同時會被沉默。
	射線傷害和持續傷害受法術強度加成。]], "tformat")
t("Reckless Strike", "捨身一擊", "talent name")
t("#CRIMSON#(%d reckless backlash)#LAST#", "#CRIMSON#(%d 捨身一擊反傷)#LAST#", "tformat")
t("Hits the target doing %d%% weapon damage. This attack cannot miss, and ignores all armor and resistances on the target. However, you take damage equal to %d%% of the damage dealt, or 30%% of your current HP, whichever is lower.", [[攻擊目標，造成 %d%% 武器傷害。本次攻擊必中，且無視目標護甲和抗性。
	但是，你自己會受到輸出傷害的 %d%% 或者當前生命值 30%% 的傷害，取數值較低者。]], "tformat")
t("Share the Pain", "以眼還眼", "talent name")
t([[You revel in the heat of battle. Whenever an enemy damages you within melee range, you have a %d%% chance to counter with an attack for %d%% weapon damage.
		You get once chance to deal this damage to a particular target each turn.]], [[你沉迷於戰爭的狂熱。當一個近身的敵對生物傷害你時，有 %d%% 機率自動反擊，造成 %d%% 武器傷害。
	此效果每回合對同一目標觸發一次。]], "tformat")

------------------------------------------------
section "tome-ashes-urhrok/data/talents/corruptions/corruptions.lua"

t("corruption", "墮落", "talent category")
t("demon seeds", "惡魔之種", "talent type")
t("Demon seeds powers can not be learnt, they must be used from demon seeds attached to your equipment.", "惡魔種子的力量不是人能學會的，必須通過裝備來展現。", "_t")
t("demonic pact", "惡魔契約", "talent type")
t("Bind and use demons to do your bidding.", "驅使惡魔爲你作戰。", "_t")
t("infernal combat", "地獄格鬥", "talent type")
t("Imbue your melee attacks with lethal demonic powers.", "利用致命的惡魔之力強化近戰攻擊。", "_t")
t("doom shield", "毀滅之盾", "talent type")
t("Imbue yourself with the forces of Mal'Rok, the demon's homeworld, to protect and enhance.", "運用來自惡魔家鄉瑪·洛克的力量保護強化自身。", "_t")
t("black-magic", "黑暗魔法", "talent type")
t("That Old Black Magic.", "古老的黑魔法。", "_t")
t("doom covenant", "末日降臨", "talent type")
t("Control darkness to crush your foes.", "使用黑暗之力擊潰敵人。", "_t")
t("spellblaze", "魔法大爆炸", "talent type")
t("Use the very power of the Spellblaze to destroy your foes.", "調用魔法大爆炸的特殊力量摧毀敵人。", "_t")
t("brutality", "殘暴", "talent type")
t("Devastating two-handed physical attacks fueled by demonic power.", "用惡魔之力驅使雙手武器，施展毀滅性的打擊。", "_t")
t("torture", "折磨", "talent type")
t("Cripple your enemies with vicious two-handed attacks.", "用惡毒的雙手攻擊讓敵人殘廢。", "_t")
t("wrath", "憤怒", "talent type")
t("Destroy your enemies with intense two-handed physical attacks fueled by demonic power.", "用惡魔之力驅使雙手武器，毀滅你的敵人。", "_t")
t("Fearfire", "恐懼之炎", "talent type")
t("Call upon the flames of the Fearscape, incinerating all.", "召喚惡魔空間的火炎，燃盡一切。", "_t")
t("Heart of Fire", "獄火之核", "talent type")
t("Fire is your lifeblood; it revitalizes you as it burns your foes.", "火是你的生命之源，它給予你力量，同時灼燒敵人。", "_t")
t("demonic strength", "惡魔之力", "talent type")
t("Infuse your body with the power of Demons.", "使用惡魔之力強化自身。", "_t")
t("Oppression", "壓制", "talent type")
t("Make your blows terrify your foes and manipulate their fear.", "你的攻擊令敵人聞風喪膽。", "_t")
t("Demon", "惡魔", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
section "tome-ashes-urhrok/data/talents/corruptions/demon-seeds.lua"

t("Flame Bolts", "近戰火球", "talent name")
t([[Randomly (%d%% chance) hurls up to %d flame bolts dealing %0.2f fire damage to foes in sight when you hit in melee.
		The damage will increase with your Spellpower.]], [[當你近戰攻擊命中時，有 %d%% 機率釋放至多 %d 個火球，造成 %0.2f 點火焰傷害。
		傷害受法術強度加成。]], "tformat")
t("Fiery Cleansing", "火焰淨化", "talent name")
t("%s is cured!", "%s 被治癒！", "logSeen")
t("Deals 20%% of your total life to cleanse your afflictions, removing up to %d physical, mental or magical detrimental effects.", "消耗 20%% 最大生命值來淨化自己，移除最多 %d 個物理，精神或魔法負面效果。", "tformat")
t("Farstrike", "遠程打擊", "talent name")
t("You send your weapon flying to the target, dealing %d%% weapon damage.", "扔出武器攻擊遠處敵人，造成 %d%% 武器傷害。", "tformat")
t("Corrosive Slashes", "腐蝕鞭笞", "talent name")
t([[You cover your weapon in acid, turning all melee damage into acid.
		All melee attacks also gain %d armor penetration.]], [[用酸液覆蓋武器，近戰傷害轉變爲酸性。
		近戰攻擊獲得 %d 護甲穿透。]], "tformat")
t("Acidic Bath", "酸浴", "talent name")
t([[You spawn a pool of acid in radius 4 around you for %d turns, dealing %0.2f acid damage to all creatures, including you.
		You also gain 40%% acid resistance and %d%% acid affinity.
		The damage scales with your Spellpower.]], [[在半徑 4 的範圍內製造持續 %d 回合的酸池，造成 %0.2f 酸性傷害（包括自己）。
		你獲得 40%% 酸性抗性與 %d%% 酸性傷害吸收。
		傷害受法術強度加成。]], "tformat")
t("Blighted Path", "枯萎之路", "talent name")
t("Blighted Path", "枯萎之路", "_t")
t("Select a use for the %s charge(s):", "選擇%s次充能的用途:", "tformat")
t("Shield for %d damage (50%% reflect).", "產生護盾，抵擋%d傷害 (50%% 反射)。", "tformat")
t("Attack for #DARK_GREEN#%0.2f blight damage", "攻擊造成#DARK_GREEN#%0.2f枯萎傷害", "tformat")
t("Restore #904010#%0.2f vim", "恢復#904010#%0.2f活力值", "tformat")
t([[Each time you walk or move you gain a blight charge. You can store up to %d charges.
		When you de-activate the talent you can use the charges to either:
		- restore %0.2f vim per charge
		- deal %0.2f blight damage per charge to a target in range %d.
		- create a shield absorbing %d per chage damage and refelcting half of it back to attackers.
		The damage scales with your Spellpower.]], [[每次你行走、移動時，你獲得一次枯萎充能。你最多能積累 %d 次充能。
		當你取消該技能時，你會消耗這一充能，選擇造成以下效果之一
		- 每層充能恢復 %0.2f 活力值
		- 對 %d 碼內的一個目標，每層充能造成 %0.2f 枯萎傷害。
		- 製造護盾，每層充能吸收 %d 傷害，並將一半的傷害返還給攻擊者。
		傷害受法術強度加成。]], "tformat", {1,2,4,3,5})
t("Corrupt Light", "腐化之光", "talent name")
t([[Weave darkness in a radius of %d. All unlit grids contribute to your power by increasing all your damage done for %d turns.
		Damage increase depends on the number of grids extinguished.]], [[在半徑 %d 範圍內擴散黑暗。每一塊黑暗的地形，都在接下來的 %d 回合裏增加你的傷害。
		傷害增加效果受熄滅的地格數量加成。]], "tformat")
t("Shadowmeld", "暗影融合", "talent name")
t([[Whenever you are on an unlit grid you can meld with the shadows, gaining %d stealth power.
		While stealthed you wrap shadows around you in a defensive cloak, giving you a %d%% chance to ignore physical or magical detrimental effects.
		Your equiped lite does not count and will be turned off when activating.
		Moving will cancel the effect.
		Stealth power depends on Spellpower.]], [[每當你站在黑暗地形時，你能與黑暗融合，獲得 %d 潛行強度。
		當你潛行時，你周圍的黑暗在你的身邊形成了一道防禦型的屏障，你有 %d%% 機率擺脫物理或魔法負面效果。
		你的燈具不會計算在內，同時效果激活時燈具將自動關閉。
		移動會取消該效果。
		潛行強度受法術強度加成。]], "tformat")
t("Blood Shield", "鮮血護盾", "talent name")
t("You require a weapon and a shield to use this talent.", "你需要一把武器一個盾牌來施展這個技能。", "logPlayer")
t([[By channeling doom forces in your shield you constantly apply 15%% of its block value as a flat damage reduction against all damage.
		Whenever you are hit in melee your shield retaliates automatically for %d%% of its block value as fire and darkness damage.]], [[在盾牌中引導毀滅之力，使你受到的全體傷害減少 15%% 格擋值。
		每次你被近戰攻擊命中時，你的盾牌會自動反擊，造成 %d%% 格擋值的火焰暗影混合傷害。]], "tformat")
t("Silence", "沉默", "talent name")
t("Corrupt the target, silencing it for %d turns.", "腐化目標，使之沉默 %d 回合。", "tformat")
t("Fiery Portal", "火焰傳送門", "talent name")
t("fiery portal", "火焰傳送門", "_t")
t([[Create two interlinked portals for %d turns.
		Only you can use the portal willingly.
		If a creature stands on the other end of the portal when you enter, you will switch places with it.]], [[製造兩個連接在一起的傳送門，持續 %d 回合。
		只有你可以主動使用這個傳送門。
		如果當你進入傳送門的時候，目標點上有一個生物，你會和它換位。]], "tformat")
t("Doom Tendrils", "末日觸鬚", "talent name")
t([[You turn into a pillar of doom, sprouting flame tendrils in radius 2 around you.
		All foes hit by the tendrils take %0.2f fire damage per turn.
		If the creature suffers damage from the fire it is pinned to the ground.]], [[你化身爲末日之柱，在周圍 2 碼的範圍內產生火焰觸鬚。
		被火焰觸鬚擊中的敵人每回合受到 %0.2f 火焰傷害。
		受到傷害的生物同時會被定身。]], "tformat")
t("Doomed Nature", "自然末日", "talent name")
t([[You curse a target for 5 turns to sever its connection to Nature.
		Each time it tries to use a natural or psionic power it has %d%% chances to fail and instead trigger a fireball of radius 1 doing %0.2f fire damage.
		The damage increases with you Spellpower stat.]], [[你詛咒目標 5 回合，割裂其與自然的聯繫。
		每次被詛咒的目標試圖使用自然或靈能力量時，有 %d%% 機率失敗並製造一個火球，對半徑 1 內的生物造成 %0.2f 火焰傷害。
		傷害受法術強度加成。]], "tformat")
t("Acid Burst", "酸性爆發", "talent name")
t([[Whenever you block an attack with your shield, you release a cloud of acidic vapour, dealing %d damage in an area of radius 3 over %d turns.
		The damage will increase with your spellpower.]], [[每次你格擋攻擊時，將釋放少量酸性氣體，在半徑 3 的範圍內造成持續 %d 回合的 %d 傷害。
		傷害受法術強度加成。]], "tformat")
t("Corrosive Cone", "錐形酸液", "talent name")
t([[When you deal a critical strike in melee, you send out a cone of acid, dealing %d damage to all enemies and melting walls you hit.
		The damage will increase with your Spellpower.]], [[每次近戰暴擊時，將釋放一股錐形酸液，造成 %d 傷害並融化牆壁。
		傷害受法術強度加成。]], "tformat")
t("Armoured Leviathan", "重裝上陣", "talent name")
t([[You enchant your shield to grant you power for %d turns.
		While the effect last your Strength and Magic stats are increased by 10%% of your shield block value.]], "你利用盾牌來強化自身，力量和魔法增加 10%% 格擋值 ,持續 %d 回合。", "tformat")
t("Flash Block", "瞬間格擋", "talent name")
t("In a fiery display of speed you raise your shield to block instantly.", "在閃電般的速度中，你瞬間舉起盾牌格擋。", "tformat")
t("Blackice", "黑冰", "talent name")
t([[Each time your kill a creature with non-fire damage you gain a blackice charge for 20 turns (stacking to %d).
		At any moment you can use a charge to infect a creature with blackice, reducing its fire and physical resistance by %d%% for 7 turns.]], [[每次你用非火焰傷害殺死生物時，你獲得一次黑冰充能，持續 20 回合，最多累計 %d 次。
		任何時候，你能消耗一次充能，用黑冰感染一個生物，降低其 %d%% 火焰和物理抗性 7 回合。]], "tformat")
t("Doomfire", "毀滅之火", "talent name")
t([[Raging flames burn foes and allies alike, doing %0.2f fire damage in a radius of %d each turn for %d turns.
		Demons standing in the doomfire will instead be healed.
		The damage will increase with your Spellpower.]], [[向地上釋放一片火焰，每回合可對敵我雙方造成 %0.2f 火焰傷害，半徑 %d 碼，持續 %d 回合。 
		站在毀滅之火中的惡魔不會被傷害，而會被治療。
		傷害受法術強度加成。]], "tformat")
t("Pain Affinity", "痛苦協調", "talent name")
t([[Whenever you take blight damage you bask in the sweet pain for 2 turns, increasing all damage affinity by 15%%.
		This can only happen every %d turns.]], [[每當你受到枯萎傷害，你沐浴痛苦的甜美，在 2 回合內獲得 15%% 傷害吸收。
		這一效果最多每 %d 回合觸發一次。]], "tformat")
t("Hexed Shield", "邪術護盾", "talent name")
t([[Whenever you block an attack with your shield, you randomly hex the attacker with one of the hexes: Pacification, Domination, Burning or Empathic as if cast at talent level %d.
		This may only happen once per turn.]], [[當你使用盾牌格擋一次攻擊，你會朝攻擊者釋放一個隨機邪術： 寧神邪術、支配邪術、燃燒邪術或是轉移邪術，技能等級爲 %d 。
		這一效果最多每回合觸發一次。]], "tformat")
t("Cursed Arm", "詛咒之手", "talent name")
t([[Whenever make a melee attack, you have a %d%% chance to randomly curse the target with one of the curses: Defenselessness, Impotence, Death or Vulnerability as if cast at talent level %d.
		This may only happen once per turn.]], [[每當你進行一次近戰攻擊，你有 %d%% 機率隨機對目標釋放一次詛咒：衰竭詛咒、虛弱詛咒、死亡詛咒或弱點詛咒，技能等級爲 %d 。
		這一效果最多每回合觸發一次。]], "tformat")
t("Doom Storm", "毀滅風暴", "talent name")
t("firestorm", "火焰風暴", "_t")
t([[A furious fire storm rages around the caster, doing %0.2f fire damage in a radius of 3 each turn for %d turns.
		You closely control the firestorm, preventing it from harming your party members.
		The damage and duration will increase with your Spellpower.]], [[製造一片激烈的火焰風暴，每回合對施法者周圍 3 碼範圍內的目標造成 %0.2f 火焰傷害，持續 %d 回合。 
		你精確的操控火焰風暴，阻止它傷害你的隊友。 
		傷害和持續時間受法術強度加成。]], "tformat")
t("Frostfire Nova", "霜火爆炸", "talent name")
t([[Fire a blast of frostfire in radius %d, doing %0.2f fire damage and freezing creatures in ice blocks for 4 turns.
		For each frozen creature you regenerate %d vim.
		The damage will increase with your Spellpower.]], [[在半徑 %d 碼範圍內發射一團霜火，造成 %0.2f 火焰傷害，並凍結敵人 4 回合。
		你每凍結一個敵人，就恢復 %d 活力值。
		傷害受法術強度加成。]], "tformat")
t("Fetid Breath", "惡臭吐息", "talent name")
t("@Source@ breathes fetid matter!", "@Source@吐出惡臭的物質！", "_t")
t([[You breathe a mix of darkness and flight in a frontal cone of radius %d. Any target caught in the area will take %0.2f darkness/blight damage.
		In addition each time you do a melee attack there is a 10%% chance to trigger the breath at no cost.
		The damage will increase with your Spellpower.
		]], [[你朝前方 %d 碼錐形區域吐出一團黑暗的疫氣。所有被擊中的目標會受到 %0.2f 暗影/枯萎傷害。
		此外，你進行近戰攻擊的時候有 10%% 機率免費觸發一次吐息。
		傷害受法術強度加成。
		]], "tformat")
t("Blood Drinker", "飲血者", "talent name")
t([[Deal a blight-enhanced melee blow, dealing %d%% blight damage.
		If the attack hits and the creature dies in the next 2 turns you drink its essence which makes you regenerate 7 vim per turn and gain 40%% chance to evade attacks for the next %d turns.
		]], [[你使用枯萎力量強化打擊，造成 %d%% 枯萎武器傷害。
		如果攻擊命中目標，且目標在接下來 2 回合內死去，你會吸取它的精華，每回合恢復 7 活力值，並有 40%% 機率迴避攻擊，持續 %d 回合。
		]], "tformat")
t("Meteor Slam", "落星重擊", "talent name")
t("You cannot use Meteor Slam without a shield!", "你沒有盾牌，無法使用落星重擊！", "logPlayer")
t([[Using demonic forces you jump high in the sky and fall down on your target as a meteor, slamming the ground with your shield.
		The impact is so powerful it shakes the ground in radius %d, dealing a %d%% fire and physical shield attack to all foes and turning the ground into lava.]], [[你使用惡魔的力量跳上天空，然後落下，如流星一般使用盾牌重擊敵人。
		這一打擊無比強大，震撼 %d 碼範圍的地面，對所有敵人造成 %d%% 火焰物理盾牌傷害，並將地面變成岩漿。]], "tformat")
t("Blazing Phase", "烈焰突襲", "talent name")
t([[By seathing yourself in flames you phase to a distant location.
		Any creature caught in the way is burnt for %0.2f fire damage which you use to regain %d vim.
		The damage will increase with your Spellpower.
		]], [[你將自己化爲一團火焰，傳送到目標位置。
		任何路徑上的敵人都會被灼燒，受到 %0.2f 火焰傷害，你恢復 %d 活力值。
		傷害受法術強度加成。
		]], "tformat")
t("Frost Grab", "冰霜飛爪", "talent name")
t([[Grab a target and pull it next to you, covering it with frost while reducing its movement speed by 50%% for %d turns.
		The ice will also deal %0.2f cold damage.
		The damage and chance to slow will increase with your Spellpower.]], [[抓住目標並使其傳送至你身邊，冰凍目標使其移動速度 50%% 持續 %d 回合。
		冰同時也會造成 %0.2f 冰冷傷害。
		傷害受你的法術強度加成。]], "tformat")
t("Diseased Body", "疫病軀體", "talent name")
t([[Whenever you take direct damage, there is a %d%% chance that your your diseased body erupts in blight, diseasing your attacker with a random disease for %d turns.
		Each turn the disease deals %0.2f blight damage and reduce one random attribute (strength, dexterity, constitution) by %d.
		This may only happen once per turn.
		The damage increases with your spellpower.]], [[每當你受到傷害時，你充滿疫病的軀體有 %d%% 機率爆發出枯萎能量，使攻擊者感染隨機疾病，持續 %d 回合。
		疾病每回合造成 %0.2f 枯萎傷害，並會降低隨機一項屬性（力量、敏捷或體質） %d 。
		這一效果最多每回合觸發一次。
		傷害受法術強度加成。]], "tformat")
t("Volcanic Skin", "火山皮膚", "talent name")
t("raging volcano", "活火山", "_t")
t([[For every turn where you take damage you have a %d%% chance to store a seismic charge.
		You can activate this spell to consume the charges, spawning a raging volcano that lasts for 2 turns per charges.
		Each turn the volcano spews 2 flaming boulders that deal %0.2f fire and %0.2f physical damage.
		The charges quickly fade when outside of combat.
		The damage increases with your spellpower.]], [[每個你受到傷害的回合，你有 %d%% 存儲一次地震能量。
		你可以主動使用這一技能，釋放地震充能，召喚出一個火山，每層充能持續 2 回合。
		每個回合，火山會發射出 2 個熔岩巨巖，造成 %0.2f 火焰和 %0.2f 物理傷害。
		充能會在戰鬥外快速消退。
		傷害受法術強度加成。。]], "tformat")
-- untranslated text
--[==[
t("", "", "log")
--]==]


------------------------------------------------
section "tome-ashes-urhrok/data/talents/corruptions/demonic-pact.lua"

t("13%% chance to trigger a Blood Spray cast of level %d", "13%%機率觸發等級%d的鮮血噴射", "tformat")
t("Reduces duration of detrimental effects by 40%", "降低負面效果的持續時間40%", "_t")
t("+2 to all Demon Seeds, Spellblaze and Demonic Pact talents", "所有惡魔種子，魔法大爆炸系和惡魔契約系技能等級+2", "_t")
t("%s (%d/%d life, level %d)", "%s (%d/%d 生命值, 等級 %d)", "tformat")
t("demon seed", "惡魔種子", "_t")
t("The seed of a demon.", "惡魔的種子", "_t")
t("Demon status: %s.", "惡魔狀態: %s。", "tformat")
t("alive (%d%% life)", "存活 (%d%% 生命值)", "tformat")
t("dead (can not be summoned)", "死亡 (無法召喚)", "_t")
t("#CRIMSON#You extract a %s and add it to your inventory.", "#CRIMSON#你提取了一個%s並將其收入物品欄。", "logPlayer")
t("#CRIMSON#You extract a %s and bind it to your %s.", "#CRIMSON#你提取了一個%s並將其附着於你的%s。", "logPlayer")
t("#CRIMSON#You feed vim into your %s, increasing its level to %d and healing it.", "#CRIMSON#你將活力注入你的 %s ，將其等級提升到 %d ，並治療了它。", "logPlayer")
t("Demon Seed", "惡魔之種", "talent name")
t("You require a weapon and a shield to use this talent.", "你需要一把武器一個盾牌來施展這個技能。", "logPlayer")
t([[Strike a blow with your weapon for %d%% blight damage.
		If the attack hits a demonic seed tries to take hold inside your foe and you follow up with a shield strike dealing %d%% damage and dazing your target for %d turns.
		
		The seed requires a powerful host to nourish it and can only take hold in creatures that are worth experience and that are not summoned demons.
		The chance for the seed to take hold is based on the creatures rank:
		%sNormal#LAST#:  5%%
		%sElite#LAST#:  20%%
		%sRare#LAST# or %sUnique#LAST#:  50%%
		%sBoss#LAST#:  100%%
		When the host dies the seed fills with the vim of the dying creature and turns into a specific demon seed that can be used to summon that demon.
		If you already have a seed of the same time in your inventory or equipment it will instead increase its level if the host was of higher level than the seed and the demon inside will regenerate %d%% health and resurrect if it was dead.

		Higher talent levels allow for more powerful demon types.
		Implanting a seed into unique demons, if successful, will always try to grant a seed of that type, if available.]], [[對目標造成 %d%% 枯萎武器傷害。
		如果攻擊命中，你會將惡魔種子植入目標體內，然後用盾牌攻擊目標，造成 %d%% 盾牌傷害並眩暈 敵人 %d 回合。

		種子需要足夠強大的宿主來成長，它只能寄生在有經驗的生物裏，不能寄生在召喚物中。
		種子的存活機率基於宿主的級別：
		%s普通生物#LAST#:5%%
		%s精英生物#LAST#:20%%
		%s稀有#LAST#與%s史詩生物#LAST#:50%%
		%sBoss#LAST#:100%%
		當宿主死亡時，種子將吸收宿主的活力，成長爲一個特定的惡魔種子，能用於召喚惡魔。
		如果你的揹包或裝備上已經有了同類的惡魔種子，且宿主等級高於惡魔的等級，它會提升種子的等級。此外，裏面的惡魔會恢復 %d%% 生命值，如果已死則會被複活。
		
		高技能等級將帶來更強大的種子。
		如果成功將種子植入稀有惡魔的體內，且它有對應的惡魔種子的話，你將會必定獲得對應的惡魔種子。]], "tformat")
t("Bind Demon", "惡魔結合", "talent name")
t("Summon demon", "召喚惡魔", "_t")
t("Which seed to use:", "使用哪個惡魔種子：", "_t")
t("Not enough space to summon!", "沒有足夠的空間召喚。", "logPlayer")
t([[Your knowledge of demonic forces grows, allowing you to bind more seeds to you and to summon demons.
		You channel your arcane corruption through a demon seed to temporarily summon the corresponding demon for %d turns.
		Summoned demons can regen their life and resummoning them keeps the life they had when they were last used.
		If the demon dies it will not be available for summoning anymore until resurrected.
		This spell can summon demons from any seeds available in either your equipment or inventory.

		As you learn to bind more easily you can also use more seeds:
		At level 2 it lets you bind a seed to your first ring.
		At level 3 it lets you bind a seed to your shield.
		At level 4 it lets you bind a seed to your second ring.
		At level 5 it lets you bind a seed to your main body armour.
		]], [[你對惡魔力量的理解增長了，你可以將更多種子與裝備結合，且可以召喚惡魔
		你能通過惡魔種子來臨時召喚對應的惡魔 %d 回合。
		召喚出來的惡魔能回覆生命，並且保持上一次召喚結束時的生命值。
		如果惡魔死亡，將不能再使用同一個種子進行召喚，直到它被複活爲止。
		這一技能可以召喚你裝備或揹包裏的任何惡魔種子。

		隨着你對惡魔力量的瞭解更加深入，你能將更多的種子與你的裝備結合。
		技能等級 2 時你能將種子與第一個戒指結合。
		技能等級 3 時你能將種子與盾牌結合。
		技能等級 4 時你能將種子與第二個戒指結合。
		技能等級 5 時你能將種子與護甲結合。
		]], "tformat")
t("Twisted Portal", "扭曲傳送", "talent name")
t("Select a teleport location...", "選擇傳送位置...", "logPlayer")
t("The targetted phase door fizzles and works randomly!", "目標傳送門故障，隨機傳送！", "logPlayer")
t([[Teleports you randomly within a small range of up to %d grids with %d precision.
		In the spot you left you will summon a random demon from your seeds for %d turns.
		If the target area is not in line of sight, there is a chance the spell will fizzle.
		This spell requires an unsummoned, alive, demon seed equiped in a worn equipment to work.
		The range will increase with your Spellpower.]], [[傳到 %d 碼外的一個位置，誤差 %d 。
		在離開的位置，你將隨機召喚一個惡魔，持續 %d 回合。
		如果目標地點不在視線內，有一定機率失敗。
		該技能需要你的裝備上附着有至少一個未召喚的存活的惡魔種子。
		傳送距離受法術強度加成。]], "tformat")
t("Doom Concordat", "末日契約", "talent name")
t("#CRIMSON#Your %s is healed!", "#CRIMSON#你的%s被治療了！", "logPlayer")
t("#CRIMSON#Your %s is brought back to life!", "#CRIMSON#你的%s復活了！", "logPlayer")
t([[You use your demon seeds to the fullest of their potential.
		Each time you enter combat you automatically summon a random demon from your worn seeds for %d turns. Demons are only summoned if their life is over 70%% and only if not other summoned demon is from Doom Concordat.
		Each time you kill a creature a random worn demon seed with less than 100%% life will be healed for %d%% life and resurrected if it was dead and the target was an elite or more.
		In addition you feed of the arrival, departure or death of your demons, each time healing yourself for %d life.
		The healing is based on your Spellpower.]], [[你發揮你惡魔種子的全部力量。
		每當你進入戰鬥的時候，你將會自動從裝備的種子中召喚一個隨機惡魔，持續 %d 回合。惡魔只有在生命值大於 70%% 的時候纔可以被召喚，且末日契約同時最多召喚一個惡魔。
		每當你殺死一個生物，你裝備的不滿血的隨機惡魔種子將會恢復 %d%% 生命值。如果目標是精英怪以上，你可以復活一個惡魔。
		此外，每當一個惡魔降臨，離開或死亡的時候，你將會受到 %d 點治療。
		治療量受法術強度加成。]], "tformat")

------------------------------------------------
section "tome-ashes-urhrok/data/talents/corruptions/demonic-strength.lua"

t("Dismember", "肢解", "talent name")
t([[Your melee attacks cripple your targets when they critically strike, lowering their movement speed by %d%% and their accuracy by %d for %d turns.
		Additionally, you gain %d%% chance to critically strike with your melee attacks.]], [[當近戰攻擊暴擊時，致殘你的目標，降低 %d%% 移動速度和 %d 命中，持續 %d 回合。
	同時，增加 %d%% 近戰暴擊率。]], "tformat")
t("Surge of Power", "力量之潮", "talent name")
t([[Use your stored vim to supercharge your body, recovering %d stamina and %d life.
		Additionally, you will be able to survive your HP going under 0, down to -%d HP, for the next 8 turns.
		These values will increase with your Spellpower.
		Spell criticals with this talent also effect the stamina gain.]], [[你使用體內蘊藏的活力強化自己的身體，恢復 %d 點體力值和 %d 點生命值。
	同時讓你在 -%d 生命時纔會死亡，此效果持續 8 回合。
	恢復值受法術強度加成。
	法術暴擊也會增加這一技能恢復的體力值。]], "tformat")
t("Demonic Blood", "惡魔之血", "talent name")
t([[Demonic Blood flows through your veins, increasing your spellpower by %d and your maximum vim by %d.
		Additionally, you will recieve a bonus to all damage equal to %d%% of your current vim (Currently %d%%).]], [[你體內涌動着惡魔之血，增加 %d 點法術強度和 %d 點活力上限。
	同時獲得相當於當前活力 %d%% 的全傷害加成（當前 %d%% ）。]], "tformat")
t("Abyssal Shield", "深淵護盾", "talent name")
t([[Surround yourself with a defensive aura, increasing armor by %d, and inflicting %0.2f fire and %0.2f blight damage to all attacking foes.
Additionally, your vim will enhance your defences, reducing all damage by %d%% of your current vim (currently %d), but never reducing by more than half of the original damage. This will cost vim equal to 5%% of the damage blocked.
The damage will scale with your Spellpower.]], [[深淵氣息圍繞着你，增加 %d 點護甲，增加 %0.2f 點火焰、 %0.2f 點枯萎近戰反擊傷害。
	同時你的活力會增強你的防禦，減少相當於當前活力 %d%% 的傷害（目前爲 %d 點），但不會減少超過原傷害的一半。此效果會消耗等同於 5%% 減少傷害值的活力。
	傷害值受法術強度加成。]], "tformat")

------------------------------------------------
section "tome-ashes-urhrok/data/talents/corruptions/doom-covenant.lua"

t("Dark Reign", "黑暗支配", "talent name")
t([[Your affinity for the shadows grow stronger.
		Whenever one of your spells deal darkness damage you have a %d%% chance to gain 8%% to all damage affinity for 8 turns.
		If you kill a creature with darkness damage this effect always triggers.
		You can only gain one stack of Dark Reign per turn.
		This effect stacks multiplicatively up to %d times.]], [[你與陰影的聯繫更加緊密了。
		每次你使用法術造成暗影傷害時，你有 %d%% 機率獲得 8%% 全體傷害吸收，持續 8 回合。
		如果你用暗影傷害殺死一個生物，這一效果必定觸發。
		你每回合最多隻能獲得一層黑暗支配效果。
		這個效果能疊加至最多 %d 層。]], "tformat")
t("Dread End", "黑暗終結", "talent name")
t([[You learn to use death around you to an even greater advantage. 
		Each time you kill or deal damage above %d%% of a creatures max life with non-darkness damage while Dark Reign is active the death will create a pool of dark energies of radius 1 for 5 turns.
		This pool spawns on top of a random enemy within radius %d.
		Any foes standing inside will take %0.2f darkness damage each turn.
		This effect can only happen once per turn.
		The damage increases with spellpower.
		At talent level 3 your Dark Reign buff also protects you from death until reaching %d life per stack.]], [[你學會利用死亡來獲取力量。
		當黑暗支配開啓，每次你使用非暗影傷害殺死生物或造成超過 %d%% 最大生命的傷害時，產生半徑 1 的黑暗能量池，持續 5 回合。
		能量池將在半徑 %d 範圍內的隨機敵人處生成。
		任何站在裏面的敵人每回合將受到 %0.2f 點暗影傷害。
		這個效果每回合最多觸發一次。
		傷害受法術強度加成。
		技能等級 3 或以上時，當你處於黑暗支配狀態下，每一層狀態使你獲得 -%d 生命底限。]], "tformat")
t("Blood Pact", "鮮血契約", "talent name")
t([[Pay %d%% of your current life and gain 100%% darkness damage conversion for 1 turns.
			If Dark Reign is active you also gain %d stamina and %d vim per stack.]], [[支付 %d%% 當前生命值， 1 回合內你造成的所有傷害轉化爲黑暗傷害。
		如果黑暗支配開啓，每有一層，你獲得 %d 體力與 %d 活力。]], "tformat")
t("Erupting Darkness", "黑暗爆發", "talent name")
t("raging volcano", "活火山", "_t")
t([[When Dread End creates pools of darkness you can focus your raging thoughts on them to make them erupt into volcanos.
		Up to %d pools in radius %d will erupt, producing a volcano for %d turns.
		Each turn the volcano will send out fiery boulders that deal %0.2f fire and %0.2f physical damage.
		The effects will improve with your Spellpower.]], [[當黑暗終結制造出黑暗能量池時，你能將憤怒集中在內，將其轉變爲火山。
		半徑 %d 內至多 %d 個能量池將會噴發，轉化爲火山，持續 %d 回合。
		每回合火山將噴射火焰巨石，造成 %0.2f 火焰與 %0.2f 物理傷害。
		效果受法術強度加成。]], "tformat")

------------------------------------------------
section "tome-ashes-urhrok/data/talents/corruptions/doom-shield.lua"

t("Osmosis Shield", "滲透護盾", "talent name")
t("You require a weapon and a shield to use this talent.", "你需要一把武器一個盾牌來施展這個技能。", "logPlayer")
t("#SLATE#(%d turned into osmosis)#LAST#", "#SLATE#(%d到滲透護盾)#LAST#", "tformat")
t([[You infuse your shield with the energies of Urh'Rok, bringing about a magical shield that heals you for the first points of all damage you receive (based on your shield's block value) over 3 turns. This effect stacks.
		Amount is 5 + %d%% of your shield block value (currently %d).
		At level 3 if a damage dealt is at least twice as high you have %d%% chance to also remove a physical detrimental effect. This effect can only happen once per turn.
		This spell disabled automatically on rest or run.
		#{bold}#Activating the shield takes no time but de-activating it does.#{normal}#
		The damage increases with spellpower.]], [[你的盾牌充滿了惡魔能量，帶來一層魔法護盾，每回合受到第一次傷害時給予你持續 3 回合的治療（基於格擋值），治療效果可以疊加。
		治療量等於 5+ %d%% 格擋值（當前 %d 點）。
		技能等級 3 時，如果傷害在治療量兩倍以上，有 %d%% 機率解除你一個負面物理狀態。
		在休息和跑步時，該技能自動終止。
		#{bold}#開啓護盾不消耗時間，關閉護盾消耗時間。#{normal}#]], "tformat")
t("Hardened Core", "硬化之核", "talent name")
t([[Taking example from Mal'Rok, the demon's homeworld you harden yourself.
		Increases total armour by %d%% + 10 and spellpower by %d.]], [[從惡魔家鄉瑪·洛克中學習，強化自身。
		增加 10 + %d%% 總護甲值 ，獲得 %d 法術強度。]], "tformat")
t("Demonic Madness", "瘋狂旋轉", "talent name")
t([[You spin around madly with your shield, bashing all those around you for %d%% shield damage as darkness, confusing your foes for %d turns.
		At level 4 you also automatically block at the end.]], [[你瘋狂旋轉你的盾牌，攻擊周圍生物，造成 %d%% 暗影盾牌傷害並使其混亂 %d 回合。
		技能等級 4 時，你自動進入格擋狀態。]], "tformat")
t("Blighted Shield", "枯萎能量", "talent name")
t([[Your shield is infused with a powerful blight. Anytime you block and apply a counterstrike effect the target is also afflicted by a curse of impotence.
		Cursed creatures have all their damage decreased by %d%% for 5 turns.
		The effects will improve with your Spellpower.]], [[你的盾牌充滿強大的枯萎能量。每次你格擋並附加反擊狀態時，目標將被虛弱詛咒感染， 5 回合內降低 %d%% 傷害。
		效果受法術強度加成。]], "tformat")

------------------------------------------------
section "tome-ashes-urhrok/data/talents/corruptions/fearfire.lua"

t("Fearscape Shift", "煉獄之門", "talent name")
t("You can't move there.", "你不能移動至那裏。", "logSeen")
t("The spell fizzles!", "法術失敗了!", "logSeen")
t([[Open a gateway to the Fearscape, stepping through it to a nearby location. As you step out, a burst of fire will leave with you, dealing %0.2f demonfire damage to everyone within %d spaces and leaving flames which will deal an additional %0.2f demonfire damage over 4 turns.
		Additionally, shifting through reality enhances your awareness, allowing you to see all enemies within %d spaces for the next 3 turns.
		The damage will scale with your Spellpower and the range will increase with the talent level.]], [[開啓通往惡魔空間的煉獄之門，踏入並傳送到附近位置。 
	當你踏出煉獄之門時，煉獄之火隨之噴發，造成 %0.2f 惡魔之火傷害，傷害 %d 碼內所有生物。地上的餘燼會造成持續 4 回合的額外 %0.2f 惡魔之火傷害。

	穿越空間增強了你的直覺，讓你能夠在 3 回合內覺察到 %d 碼內的所有敵對生物。 
 
	傷害受法術強度加成，範圍隨技能等級增大。]], "tformat")
t("Cauterize Spirit", "靈魂焚淨", "talent name")
t([[Removes all detrimental effects but causes you to burn for %d%% of your max health per effect, over 7 turns.
		This ignores all resists, defenses, and affinities.
		This does not take a turn.]], [[移除所有負面狀態，但每移除一個狀態，會在 7 回合內灼燒自身，受到合計 %d%% 最大生命值的傷害。
	傷害無視一切抗性、防禦效果和傷害吸收。
	
此技能瞬發。]], "tformat")
t("Infernal Breath", "地獄吐息", "talent name")
t([[Exhale a wave of dark fire with radius %d, lasting 4 turns. Any non-demon caught in the area will take %0.2f fire damage, and flames will be left dealing a further %0.2f each turn. Demons will be healed for the same amount.
		The damage will increase with your Strength Stat, but critically hit as a spell.]], [[在 %d 碼的錐形範圍內，噴出持續 4 回合的暗黑火焰。
	範圍內所有的非惡魔生物受到 %0.2f 火焰傷害，同時火焰會造成每回合 %0.2f 的灼燒傷害。
	惡魔受到等量的治療。
 
	傷害受力量加成，該技能使用魔法暴擊率。]], "tformat")
t("Maw of Urh'rok", "烏魯洛克之胃", "talent name")
t([[Your body becomes a nexus for the Fearscape, causing you to drag enemies towards you in a cone with a radius of %d, dealing %0.2f fire damage every turn.
		The damage will increase with your Spellpower.]], [[你的身體成爲惡魔空間與現實的紐帶，將 %d 碼的錐形範圍內的敵人抓過來，同時每回合造成 %0.2f 點火焰傷害。
傷害受法術強度加成。]], "tformat")

------------------------------------------------
section "tome-ashes-urhrok/data/talents/corruptions/heart-of-fire.lua"

t("Burning Sacrifice", "燃燒獻祭", "talent name")
t([[Whenever you kill a burning enemy, you will instantly deal a melee attack against a random adjacant enemy at %d%% power. 
		Additionally, Incinerating Blows will always trigger on this attack (or your next attack), dealing %d%% of its normal damage to all enemies hit and stunning, ignoring the cooldown.
		This can only trigger once every 5 turns.]], [[每次你擊殺一個燃燒的敵對生物時，會立刻對一個隨機相鄰敵對生物進行一次攻擊，造成 %d%% 武器傷害。
	另外，焚盡強擊必定被此效果觸發（或者下一次攻擊），對所有擊中的敵對生物造成 %d%% 倍傷害。
	此效果每 5 回合才能觸發一次。]], "tformat")
t("Fiery Aegis", "火焰守護", "talent name")
t([[Draw in the raging fires and envelop yourself in them. Remove all burns from enemies in a radius of 5 around you, and create a shield lasting %d turns with a power of %d, increased by 15%% for each burn removed.
		When the shield ends, it releases a burst of fire in a radius of %d around you, burning all enemies for 3 turns, doing damage equal to the initial power of the shield.]], [[吸取燃燒中的烈焰，將自己包裹其中。
		除去半徑 5 內的敵方生物身上的燃燒效果，同時製造一層持續 %d 輪的 %d 強度的護盾，每吸收一層燃燒效果護盾強度增加 15%% 。
		當護盾效果結束時，將在半徑 %d 範圍內釋放一次火焰爆炸，灼燒周圍生物 3 回合，造成等於護盾初始值的傷害。]], "tformat")
t("Devouring Flames", "吞噬之焰", "talent name")
t([[Your connection to fire nourishes you. Whenever you strike an enemy in melee, you inflict a burning curse upon them. As long as they continue to burn, you gain %0.2f health and %0.2f vim per turn.
		Each turn they remain within 10 spaces of you, all enemies with cursed flames will spread it to other burning enemies in radius 1, causing you to heal for the same amount for each enemy, as well as dealing %d fire damage on spreading.]], [[惡魔之炎撫育你成長。每次你近戰攻擊命中時，你對目標施加詛咒，只要其處於燃燒狀態，你每回合獲得 %0.2f 生命與 %0.2f 活力。 
	同時，在你周圍 10 碼範圍內，所有被詛咒火焰燃燒的敵方生物會將詛咒傳播至半徑 1 內的燃燒生物上，並造成 %d 火焰傷害同時給予你等量治療。]], "tformat")
t("Blazing Rebirth", "烈焰重生", "talent name")
t("Restore yourself to full health, but take damage equal to the damage healed over %d turns. This damage is split evenly among you and all burning enemies in radius %d. Damage you take is irresistable. Damage to enemies is fire damage.", [[生命值恢復爲滿值，但治療值轉化爲持續 %d 回合的傷害。 
	傷害會平均分配給你自己和 %d 碼範圍內的燃燒敵對生物。
	你受到的傷害無法減免，敵對生物受到火焰傷害。]], "tformat")

------------------------------------------------
section "tome-ashes-urhrok/data/talents/corruptions/infernal-combat.lua"

t("Flame Leash", "火焰束縛", "talent name")
t([[Tendrils of flame fire from your hands in a narrow cone. Any foes caught inside will be pulled in towards you and have its movement speed reduced by %d%% for 4 turns.
		Each tendril will leave a trail of fire in its path dealing %0.2f fire damage for 4 turns.
		The damage increases with spellpower.]], [[火焰觸鬚從你的手中伸出，在錐形範圍內伸展。
		被火焰觸鬚抓住的生物將被拉過來，同時移動速度減少 %d%% ，持續 4 回合。
		每個觸鬚會留下火焰痕跡，每回合造成 %0.2f 火焰傷害，持續 4 回合。
		傷害受法術強度加成。]], "tformat")
t("Demon Blade", "惡魔之刃", "talent name")
t([[Imbue your weapon with fire for 5 turns. During this time all your melee hits will trigger a ball of fire of radius 1 dealing %0.2f fire damage.
		This effect can only happen once per turn.
		The damage increases with spellpower.]], [[向你的武器灌輸火焰之力，持續 5 回合。
		每次近戰攻擊時會釋放一個火球，在半徑 1 的範圍內造成 %0.2f 火焰傷害。
		這個效果每回合只能觸發一次。
		傷害受法術強度加成。]], "tformat")
t("Link of Pain", "苦痛鏈接", "talent name")
t("Select the source:", "選擇目標:", "logPlayer")
t("Select the victim:", "選擇受害者:", "logPlayer")
t([[Using demonic forces you create a link of pain from a source creature to a victim for %d turns.
		Each time the source creature takes damage the victim takes %d%% of the damage.
		If the victim dies from the effect you gain a burst of energy, reducing all remaining cooldowns by 1.]], [[使用惡魔之力，你在源生物與犧牲生物間構造痛苦鏈接，持續 %d 回合。
		每次源生物受到傷害時， %d%% 傷害由犧牲生物承受。
		當犧牲生物因此效果死亡時，你將獲得能量，減少所有技能冷卻時間 1 回合。]], "tformat")
t("Demon Horns", "惡魔之角", "talent name")
t("You require a weapon and a shield to use this talent.", "你需要一把武器一個盾牌來施展這個技能。", "logPlayer")
t("%s resists the shield bash!", "%s抵抗了盾牌猛擊！", "logSeen")
t([[Demon horns temporarily grow on your shield as you bash a foe with it for %d%% damage.
		If the attack hits the creature is impaled by the horns, causing it to bleed black blood for 50%% of the damage done as darkness over 5 turns.
		Any time you damage this foe in melee while it bleeds you get healed for %d (this can only happen once per turn).
		The healing power increases with your spellpower.]], [[你的盾牌上長出臨時的惡魔之角。
		你盾擊敵人造成 %d%% 傷害。
		如果攻擊命中，目標將被惡魔角刺穿，流血 5 回合，合計受到額外 50%% 黑暗傷害。
		每次你攻擊被惡魔角刺穿的目標時，你回覆 %d 生命 (每回合至多 1 次 )。
		治療效果受法術強度加成。]], "tformat")

------------------------------------------------
section "tome-ashes-urhrok/data/talents/corruptions/npcs.lua"

t("Soul Eater", "靈魂吞噬者", "talent name")
t("#CRIMSON#%s is bound to %s will.", "#CRIMSON#%s被綁定到%s的意志。", "logSeen")
t("#PURPLE#As %s falls down you see %s reach to it, devour its essence and raise it back as a demonic husk.", "#PURPLE#當%s倒下時，你看到%s靠向它，吞噬了它的精華，並將其復活爲惡魔軀殼。", "logSeen")
t("%s (demonic husk)", "%s (惡魔屍傀)", "tformat")
t([[Any nearby allied creature that is not a summon will be bound to your will.
		Each time a creature bound to your will dies it is resurrected as a demonic husk.
		Demonic husks have:
		- slow movement speed
		- more life
		- new demonic talents]], [[任何附近的友方非召喚生物將與你的意志鏈接。
		每次與你意志鏈接的生物死亡時，將會以惡魔屍傀的形式復活。
		惡魔屍傀具有如下性質：
		- 緩慢的移動速度
		- 更多生命值
		- 新的惡魔技能]], "tformat")

------------------------------------------------
section "tome-ashes-urhrok/data/talents/corruptions/oppression.lua"

t("Horrifying Blows", "恐懼打擊", "talent name")
t([[Your successful melee hits apply a stacking effect that decreases damage done by %d%%.
		You can have up to %d stacks per target and further attacks refresh the duration, but any turn you are farther than %d spaces from the victim the fear will wear off quickly.
		At level 3 it also slows by %0.2f%% per stack.
		At level 5 you can horrify enemies in a radius of %d.
		This talent ignores saves and immunities.
		]], [[你的攻擊能夠驚嚇目標，降低目標 %d%% 的傷害。 
	此效果可以疊加 %d 次，每次攻擊會刷新持續時間。但是當目標與你距離超過 %d 碼，恐懼效果會迅速消退。
	技能 3 級時，每次疊加會同時減少目標 %0.2f%% 的速度。
	技能 5 級時，可以影響到 %d 碼內的所有敵對生物。
	此技能無視豁免和免疫。]], "tformat")
t("Mass Hysteria", "恐懼之潮", "talent name")
t("Amplifies the power of your fear on the target by %d%% per stack and sets its duration to %d.  The amplified fear spreads to all enemies in a radius of %d.", "增強目標的恐懼，目標身上每有一次恐懼疊加，效果增強 %d%% ，持續時間增大到 %d 回合。增強後的恐懼效果影響 %d 碼內所有敵對生物。", "tformat")
t("Fearfeast", "恐懼盛宴", "talent name")
t("You gain %.1f turns!", "你獲得了%.1f個回合！", "logPlayer")
t("You consume the fear of enemies in radius %d, healing for %d life and gaining %0.1f%% of a turn for each stack up to a max of %.1f turns.", [[汲取 %d 碼內敵對生物身上的恐懼，每汲取一層恐懼，恢復 %d 生命並獲得 %0.1f%% 額外回合。
	至多能獲得 %.1f 個額外回合。]], "tformat")
t("Hope Wanes", "絕望碾壓", "talent name")
t([[You crush the spirit of a target with at least %d fear stacks, consuming all stacks and making it unable to act for %d turns.
		This talent ignores saves and immunities.]], [[擊潰已疊加至少 %d 層恐懼目標的精神，清除所有恐懼效果，使目標 %d 回合無法行動。
	此技能無視豁免和免疫。]], "tformat")

------------------------------------------------
section "tome-ashes-urhrok/data/talents/corruptions/spellblaze.lua"

t("Rain of Fire", "隕星火雨", "talent name")
t([[You unleash the fury of the Spellblaze, constantly draining your vim.
		While this spell is active at most two meteors will fall near your per turn, dealing %0.2f physical and %0.2f fire damage in radius 2.
		This spell disabled automatically on rest or run.
		The effects increase with spellpower.]], [[你釋放魔法大爆炸的力量，持續消耗活力。
		當技能開啓時，每回合將召喚 2 個隕石墜落在你身邊，在半徑 2 的範圍內造成 %0.2f 物理與 %0.2f 火焰傷害。
		這項法術在休息或跑步時自動關閉。
		效果受法術強度加成。]], "tformat")
t("Only Ashes Left", "唯餘灰燼", "talent name")
t([[Bringing about the darkest days of the Spellblaze you hasten the death of your foes.
		When you deal damage to a creature in radius %d or less around you and it dips below 33%% life you automatically unleash the fury of the Spellblaze.
		Affected foes will start taking %0.2f darkness damage each turn until it dies as long as it remains in radius %d of you.
		The damage increases with spellpower.]], [[通過引發魔法大爆炸最黑暗的時候的場景，你加速了敵人的死亡。
		每次你對半徑 %d 內的生物造成傷害後，如果它生命值低於 33%% ，將會承受魔法大爆炸的力量。
		受影響的敵人每回合將受到 %0.2f 暗影傷害，直到死亡或者離開你範圍 %d 碼範圍。
		傷害受法術強度加成。]], "tformat")
t("Shattered Mind", "精神破碎", "talent name")
t([[When you block an attack the shock ripples through your attacker, spreading the force of the Spellblaze in its mind for 5 turns.
		While affected the creature will suffer %d%% chances to fail using talents and %d reduced physical, mental and spell saves.]], [[當你格擋攻擊時，你能將魔法大爆炸的力量傳導至攻擊者的精神中，持續 5 回合。
		受影響的生物每次使用技能時有 %d%% 機率失敗，同時全體豁免下降 %d 點。]], "tformat")
t("Tale of Destruction", "毀滅傳說", "talent name")
t([[You chant the destruction of Mal'Rok, the demon's homeworld.
		Each time you kill a creature you send out a magical ripple in radius %d that applies a bane of blindness or confusion for %d turns.
		Baned creatures also suffer %0.2f darkness damage per turn.
		Damage increases with your spellpower.]], [[你讚頌惡魔家鄉瑪·洛克的毀滅。
		每次你殺死生物時，你將釋放魔法波動，在半徑 %d 範圍內的生物將承受 %d 回合的混亂或目盲毒素。
		中毒的生物每回合將受到 %0.2f 暗影傷害。
		傷害受法術強度加成。]], "tformat")

------------------------------------------------
section "tome-ashes-urhrok/data/talents/corruptions/torture.lua"

t("Incinerating Blows", "焚盡強擊", "talent name")
t([[The power of the Fearscape infuses your weapon: Your melee attacks will deal %0.2f fire damage, spread over 3 turns.
		Additionally, every time you attack, there is a %d%% chance of releasing a burst of powerful fire that will deal %0.2f fire damage to all enemies in radius %d over %d turns.
		If this talent is not on cooldown, the burst of fire will instead be radius %d, and stun all targets in addition to burning them.
		For the purposes of applying the stun, you have %d bonus spellpower.
		The damage will increase with your Spellpower.]], [[惡魔空間的力量注入你的武器：你的近戰攻擊在 3 回合內造成 %0.2f 點火焰傷害。
	另外，每次攻擊時有 %d%% 機率造成 %0.2f 火焰燃燒傷害， %d 碼內的所有敵人都會受到此傷害，燃燒持續 %d 回合。
	若該技能冷卻完畢，則火焰爆發將聚集在 %d 碼範圍內，併產生火焰震懾效果。
	進行震懾判定時，額外增加 %d 點法術強度。
	傷害受法術強度加成。]], "tformat")
t("Abduction", "鎖魂之鏈", "talent name")
t("You require a two handed weapon to use this talent.", "你需要裝備一把雙手武器來施展這個技能。", "logPlayer")
t("Hits the target doing %d%% weapon damage. If the attack hits, you pull the target in and strike them again, dealing another %d%% weapon damage.", [[對目標攻擊，造成 %d%% 武器傷害。
	如果命中，將目標抓到身邊並再次攻擊，造成 %d%% 武器傷害。]], "tformat")
t("Fiery Torment", "灼魂之罰", "talent name")
t([[Hits the target with your weapon doing %d%% weapon damage. If the attack hits, the target is afflicted with Fiery Torment for %d turns, reducing their fire resistance by %d%%.
		When Fiery Torment ends the victim will take %d fire damage. This damage will increase by %d%% of all damage taken while under torment.
		The damage dealt by the effect will increase with spellpower.
		Demons under fiery torment will be burned by the flames of the Fearscape.]], [[用武器攻擊敵人，造成 %d%% 武器傷害。如果命中，目標受到灼魂之罰的影響，持續 %d 回合 , 火焰抗性降低 %d%% 。
	當灼魂之罰結束，敵人會受到 %d 點火焰傷害。 
	在灼魂之罰持續時間內目標受到的所有傷害，有 %d%% 會加成到火焰傷害中。
	被灼魂之罰影響的惡魔會被惡魔空間中的火焰焚燒。]], "tformat")
t("Eternal Suffering", "無盡苦痛", "talent name")
t([[Your strikes are imbued with a vile power that extends your victim's suffering. When hitting in melee, you have a (%d%%) chance to extend the length of all negative effects and reduce the length of all positive effects on the target by %d turn(s).
		This can only trigger on any particular target once every 6 turns.]], [[你的攻擊充溢着惡毒的力量，能夠延長敵人的苦痛。當近戰命中時，有 %d%% 機率延長對方所有的負面狀態持續時間並降低所有正面狀態的持續時間，增減幅度爲 %d 回合。
	該效果對同一目標每 6 回合才能生效一次。]], "tformat")

------------------------------------------------
section "tome-ashes-urhrok/data/talents/corruptions/wrath.lua"

t("Obliterating Smash", "殲滅揮斬", "talent name")
t("You require a two handed weapon to use this talent.", "你需要裝備一把雙手武器來施展這個技能。", "logPlayer")
t([[Swing your weapon with incredible force, striking all enemies in a radius %d semicircle, dealing %d%% weapon damage to all targets.
		Starting from talent level 5, all targets hit will have their armour and saves reduced by %d.
		This attack can not miss.]], [[用無與倫比的力量揮動武器，打擊正面半圓 %d 碼範圍內所有敵對生物，對所有目標造成 %d%% 武器傷害。
	技能 5 級時，被擊中敵對生物的護甲和豁免會降低 %d 點。
	此攻擊必中。]], "tformat")
t("Detonating Charge", "爆裂衝鋒", "talent name")
t("You require a two handed weapon and being able to move to use this talent.", "你需要裝備一把雙手武器且可以移動，才能施展這個技能", "logPlayer")
t("You can not do that currently.", "目前你不能這樣做。", "logPlayer")
t("You are too close to build up momentum!", "離開目標太近無法施展！", "logPlayer")
t([[Launch yourself toward a target. If the target is reached you get a free attack doing %d%% weapon damage.
		If the attack hits you release a massive burst of fire in radius %d, knocking away all enemies except your target and dealing %d damage.
		You must charge from at least 2 tiles away.]], [[向目標衝鋒，如果到達目標位置，則攻擊目標造成 %d%% 武器傷害。
	若攻擊命中，將釋放強烈的火焰衝擊，擊退 %d 碼之內目標之外的所有敵對生物，並造成 %d 傷害。
	至少要從 2 碼外開始衝鋒。]], "tformat")
t("Voracious Blade", "饕餮之刃", "talent name")
t([[Your blade drinks in death. Whenever you score a kill with this talent off cooldown, your next %d melee attacks within 6 turns will always critically strike, and you gain %d%% critical multiplier for the duration.
		Additionally, you gain an extra %d vim per kill.]], [[你的利刃充滿着對殺戮的渴望。
	在技能冷卻完畢後，當殺死敵人時，接下來 6 回合內的 %d 次近戰攻擊必定暴擊，在持續時間內，暴擊係數增加 %d%% 。
	另外，每次擊殺時額外獲得 %d 點活力。]], "tformat")
t("Destroyer", "毀滅者", "talent name")
t([[Your body overflows with the power of the Fearscape, turning you into a powerful demon for %d turns. This increases your stamina regen and physical power by %d, and your disarm and stun immunity by %d%%.
		The physical power, stamina regen, and status resistances increase with your spellpower.
		Your other talents also gain a variety of bonuses:
		-Draining Assault: Reduces cooldown by %d.
		-Reckless Strike: Gain %d%% resistance penetration for all elements for %d turns.
		-Obliterating Smash: Increases range by %d.
		-Abduction: If it hits, get an additional %d attacks at 35%% weapon damage.
		-Incinerating Blows: Increases chance of bonus damage to %d%%.
		-Fearfeast: Gain %0.1f vim per stack.
		-Maw of Urh'rok: Increases cone width by %d degrees.]], [[惡魔空間的力量充溢了你的身體，將你轉換成一個強大的惡魔，持續 %d 回合。 
	變身期間，體力恢復和物理強度增加 %d ，繳械和震懾抗性增加 %d%% 。
	物理強度，體力恢復，狀態抗性加值受法力強度加成。
	變身期間，其他技能也受到強化：
	汲魂痛擊：冷卻時間減少 %d 。
	捨身一擊：增加 %d%% 全體抗性穿透，持續 %d 回合。
	殲滅揮斬：增加半徑 %d 。
	鎖魂之鏈：如果命中，額外附加 %d 次 35%% 武器傷害的攻擊。
	焚盡強擊：增加額外傷害機率至 %d%% 。
	恐懼盛宴：每汲取一層疊加的恐懼，獲得 %0.1f 點活力。
	烏魯洛克之胃：角度增加 %d 。]], "tformat")

